window.portfolioTranslations = {"en":{"languageLabel":"Language","navAbout":"About","navWork":"Work","navContact":"Contact","intro":"HELLO, I’M TAHA","heroTitle":"Backend & AI<br><span>Engineer.</span>","heroDescription":"I build production Python systems, real-time AI experiences, and intelligent applications — from APIs to deployment.","connect":"Let’s connect","github":"GitHub","currentlyAt":"Currently at <a href=\"#work\">SpeakDuo</a>","role":"Software Engineer","portraitNote":"Turning ideas into real-world experiences","aboutKicker":"A LITTLE CONTEXT","aboutTitle":"The person behind the code.","aboutText":"I’m Taha Chelly, a software engineer based in Sfax, Tunisia. I enjoy the whole journey of building a product: connecting a clear interface, a reliable backend, and the intelligence that makes it useful.","aboutDetail":"I’m a software engineering graduate with experience building Python backends, REST APIs, and AI-powered applications using FastAPI, SQL, and Docker. I’ve contributed to production features at SpeakDuo and built end-to-end AI projects. I’m seeking a full-time Python developer role to build reliable backend services and grow in AI engineering.","tagFullStack":"Full-stack development","tagAI":"AI applications","tagRealtime":"Real-time experiences","workKicker":"WHAT I’M WORKING ON","workTitle":"Building with purpose.","current":"Current","workHeading":"Helping people learn languages.<br>One conversation at a time.","workDescription":"I build backend and AI features for SpeakDuo’s production language-learning platform, working across Python services, the web app, and real-time voice experiences.","remote":"Remote","toolkitTitle":"Some tools I work with","contactKicker":"GOOD THINGS START WITH A CONVERSATION","contactTitle":"Let’s build something<br><span>worth talking about.</span>","footerLine":"Built with care. Always evolving.","backToTop":"Back to top ↑","navProjects":"Projects","projectsKicker":"SELECTED PROJECTS","projectsTitle":"Ideas brought to life.","viewProject":"Explore project ↗","projectCategory":"AUDIO RECOGNITION · APPLIED ML · FastAPI","projectSummary":"Discover who is reciting and which verse you’re hearing. An audio recognition app for Qur’an recitation, with live listening and file uploads.","backProjects":"← All projects","liveDemo":"Try the live demo","sourceCode":"View on GitHub","screenshotsKicker":"A LOOK INSIDE","screenshotsTitle":"Two ways to explore a recitation.","reciterCaption":"Reciter recognition — upload audio or listen live.","verseCaption":"Verse discovery — find the surah and ayah from a recitation.","approachKicker":"BEHIND THE EXPERIENCE","approachTitle":"From sound to a meaningful match.","reciterTitle":"Recognize the reciter","reciterDetail":"An ECAPA-TDNN model creates a voice embedding. ONNX Runtime runs inference, then cosine similarity ranks matches against profiles for 20 reciters.","verseTitle":"Find the verse","verseDetail":"A Quran-tuned Whisper model transcribes the Arabic audio. Normalized text is matched against 6,236 verses to find likely surah and ayah matches.","contextTitle":"Listen for more context","contextDetail":"When a verse match is ambiguous, progressive listening gathers more audio context. Uncertain results stay marked as uncertain.","stackKicker":"BUILT WITH","stackTitle":"The technology behind it.","frontendDetail":"Frontend: React 19 and TypeScript, built with Vite and Tailwind CSS 4. Browser microphone capture and file uploads connect to the API.","backendDetail":"Backend: Python and FastAPI, with WebSockets for live reciter recognition. ONNX Runtime handles speaker embeddings; faster-whisper and CTranslate2 handle verse transcription.","deployDetail":"Delivery: Docker containers on Render, with Nginx serving the frontend. GitHub Actions checks the backend and frontend before deploying affected services.","tryTitle":"Hear it. Discover it.","qafiyaCategory":"ARABIC NLP · ALGORITHMS · CPU AI","qafiyaSummary":"An Arabic poetry workshop for classical meter, rhyme, readable scansion, and local vocalization.","qafiyaCaptionDesk":"Writing desk — choose a classical meter and rhyme letter, then inspect the verse.","qafiyaCaptionMobile":"Responsive Arabic-first poetry analysis on mobile.","qafiyaApproachTitle":"From a written verse to its rhythm.","qafiyaAnalysisTitle":"Analyze classical meter","qafiyaAnalysisDetail":"Check Arabic verses against 16 classical meters with PyArud. Explore the صدر and عجز, binary scansion, feet, and the requested rawi.","qafiyaTashkeelTitle":"Complete vocalization locally","qafiyaTashkeelDetail":"A bundled 4.8 MB libtashkeel ONNX model fills missing vowel marks on the CPU. Supplied vowels remain authoritative; analysis does not call an LLM.","qafiyaDraftTitle":"Drafting is experimental","qafiyaDraftDetail":"An optional provider adapter drafts poems and targets revisions at failed verses while preserving accepted text. Generation is currently disabled on the public demo.","qafiyaFrontend":"Frontend: React 19, TypeScript, and Vite, with a responsive Arabic RTL interface.","qafiyaBackend":"Backend: Python 3.12, FastAPI, PyArud, NumPy, and CPU ONNX Runtime. A single worker shares a bounded inference session.","qafiyaDeploy":"Hosting: Cloudflare Pages frontend and Render Docker API. GitHub Actions checks the frontend, backend, and production container.","qafiyaTryTitle":"Explore meter and rhyme.","generationPaused":"Analysis is available in the live demo. AI generation is currently disabled.","downloadCV":"Download CV","contactIntent":"Based in Tunisia · Open to international remote Backend & AI Engineering roles.","employmentDates":"Software Engineer · Jul 2026 — Present","internshipDates":"Previously: end-of-studies internship at SpeakDuo · Jan — Jul 2026.","achievementFeedback":"Develop multilingual grammar and pronunciation feedback that helps learners review their conversations, understand mistakes, and identify what to practice next.","achievementVoice":"Integrate live captions, translation, and AI voice interviews to support conversation practice across languages and make spoken interactions easier to follow.","writingKicker":"Engineering notebook","writingTitle":"Technical decisions, explained.","decisionsKicker":"CHALLENGES & TRADEOFFS","decisionsTitle":"Why it works this way.","readNote":"Read the engineering note","cvFormat":"PDF · 129 KB","story0Title":"When an audio match needs more context","story0Summary":"Separating speaker recognition from verse discovery, and making uncertainty part of the listening flow.","story0Section0Title":"Two questions, two pipelines","story0Section0Text":"Recognizing a voice and recognizing words are different problems. Quranic Shazam uses ECAPA-TDNN speaker embeddings with ONNX Runtime to rank 20 reciter profiles. Verse discovery instead uses a Quran-tuned Whisper model, normalizes the Arabic transcript, and matches it against 6,236 verses. The speaker model is pretrained; it is not fine-tuned on Qur’an recordings.","story0Section1Title":"Ask for context before claiming certainty","story0Section1Text":"A short recitation can fit more than one verse. Progressive listening adds audio context up to a 60-second limit, while ambiguous results remain marked as uncertain. This trades a longer listening window for more context instead of forcing an early answer.","story0Section2Title":"Keep inference away from the event loop","story0Section2Text":"Model inference runs off the asynchronous API event loop. Uploads are capped at 25 MB, with separate audio-duration limits for recognition modes. These bounds make expensive requests finite while the API supports uploads and live microphone sessions.","story0Section3Title":"Measure a defined task","story0Section3Text":"The September 5, 2026 offline evaluation reports 97.31% top-1 and 99.10% top-3 reciter recognition across 781 held-out clips, using disjoint profile and evaluation surahs. Those results describe that reciter benchmark; they do not measure verse recognition or guarantee performance on arbitrary microphones, noise, or recordings.","story1Title":"Arabic prosody on a small CPU server","story1Summary":"A 4.8 MB vocalization model, preserved vowel marks, and explicit limits on what automated analysis can claim.","story1Section0Title":"Fit the model to the hosting budget","story1Section0Text":"Qafiya pairs PyArud’s classical prosody analysis with a bundled approximately 4.8 MB libtashkeel ONNX model. Vocalization runs locally on the CPU without PyTorch, Transformers, a GPU, or an external model server. A single Uvicorn worker shares a bounded, serialized inference session, keeping model copies and simultaneous inference under control.","story1Section1Title":"Preserve the author’s text","story1Section1Text":"Existing vowel marks remain authoritative. Automatic vocalization fills missing marks and discloses changes; the interface shows the analyzed text while retaining the original input. The distinction matters because scansion depends on pronunciation, and a predicted vowel can change the result.","story1Section2Title":"Test the container, then state the limits","story1Section2Text":"The documented local whole-ASGI workload ran the production image under a 512 MiB RAM and 0.1 CPU cap, peaking at 142.55 MiB process RSS without an out-of-memory failure. This is evidence for a bounded workload, not a guarantee under arbitrary public traffic. In a separate 12-verse vocalization sample, partial-source meter matches improved from 2/12 to 10/12; fully unvocalized input reached only 2/12.","story1Section3Title":"Keep repair bounded and sound text intact","story1Section3Text":"The experimental drafting flow checks meter and the requested rawi, then revises failed verses with a bounded loop. The backend preserves accepted verses and sound hemistichs. Rawi equality is narrower than full classical rhyme validation, and machine acceptance does not certify literary quality. AI generation remains disabled in the public demo.","notebookTitle":"Engineering notebook","allNotes":"Back to all notes","noteLabel":"Engineering note","readingTime":"3 min read","articleContext":"A technical walkthrough of the implementation and evidence documented in the project repository.","contentsLabel":"On this page","sourcesTitle":"Sources & implementation","sourceReadme":"Project README","sourceEvidence":"Evaluation & evidence","exploreProject":"Explore project","continueReading":"Continue reading","writtenBy":"Written by","evidenceCaption":"Based on the project README and linked evaluations.","copyLink":"Copy link","linkCopied":"Link copied","switchDark":"Switch to dark mode","switchLight":"Switch to light mode","opensNewTab":"Opens in a new tab","technologyLabel":"Technology","contactLinksLabel":"Contact and social links","homeLabel":"Taha Chelly home","browseNotebook":"Browse the notebook","navNotebook":"Notebook","sectionLink":"Link to this section","projectSectionsLabel":"Project sections","projectScreenshots":"Screenshots","projectArchitecture":"How it works","projectDecisions":"Decisions","reciterScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam: reciter recognition screen","verseScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam: verse discovery screen","qafiyaDesktopAlt":"Qafiya: Arabic poetry analysis on desktop","qafiyaMobileAlt":"Qafiya: Arabic poetry analysis on mobile","remoteOpportunity":"Based in Tunisia · Open to international remote Backend & AI Engineering roles.","exploreProjects":"Explore Projects","reciterEvidenceContext":"Reciter recognition · offline evaluation on 781 held-out clips; verse recognition is not measured.","qafiyaEvidenceContext":"Local container workload · 142.55 MiB peak process RSS under a 512 MiB RAM cap; not a public-traffic benchmark.","reciterEvidence":"97.31% top-1 · 99.10% top-3","qafiyaEvidence":"4.8 MB · CPU ONNX","achievementPractice":"Build vocabulary tracking, review exercises, and personalized grammar practice so learners can revisit words and language patterns from their conversations.","achievementMultiplayer":"Deliver AI chat and synchronized group learning activities, connecting backend services with interactive experiences in the web app.","speakduoCaseLabel":"CASE STUDY","speakduoCaseTitle":"Helping conversations become learning opportunities.","speakduoCaseSummary":"AI chat, multilingual learning content, vocabulary tools, and interactive practice: selected contributions at SpeakDuo.","speakduoCaseLink":"Read the SpeakDuo case study","speakduoCaseBack":"← Back to experience","speakduoCaseContextTitle":"The learner’s challenge","speakduoCaseContext":"At SpeakDuo, I work on language-learning features across the backend and web app. These examples describe selected contributions from my merged work, covering AI chat, learning content, personal practice, and group activities.","speakduoCasePracticeTitle":"Personal practice","speakduoCasePractice":"I implemented phrase review with scheduled repetition and contributed to the personal grammar archive. Learners can revisit correction examples, save practice, resume unfinished sessions, and review their progress.","speakduoCaseRoleTitle":"My contribution","speakduoCaseRole":"My contributions span Python backend services, React web interfaces, integration, tests, and fixes to existing behavior. I worked within the team’s product and engineering conventions, responding to review and checking feature behavior.","speakduoCaseChatTitle":"AI chatbot","speakduoCaseChat":"I developed Ash’s AI chat feature across the backend and web app, including conversation history, streamed replies, and controls for managing discussions. I also worked on helping the assistant recommend learning features that actually exist on the platform.","speakduoCaseVoiceTitle":"AI interview voice agent and feedback","speakduoCaseVoice":"I worked on multilingual support for the AI interview voice agent and on grammar and pronunciation feedback. I also improved live caption processing and adjusted language feedback to better distinguish everyday spoken expressions from genuine mistakes.","speakduoCoverAlt":"SpeakDuo case study cover: conversation, voice, and practice illustrated with speech bubbles, an audio waveform, and a book.","speakduoCaseLessonsTitle":"Generative AI learning content","speakduoCaseLessons":"I extended AI lesson generation with multilingual support and worked on generated stories, dialogues, and grammar exercises. This included improving examples so they make sense on their own and helping learners practice words and expressions in context.","speakduoCaseVocabularyTitle":"Vocabulary and reading tools","speakduoCaseVocabulary":"I built vocabulary tracking and review features, including saved words, translation history, and word-meaning lookup. I also worked on reading experiences with generated stories and imported articles, alongside word-completion exercises and grammar quizzes.","speakduoCaseActivitiesTitle":"Interactive group activities","speakduoCaseActivities":"I implemented learning activities including trivia, Missing Word, Word Connect, and preference polls. My contributions covered activity features, host controls, and learner interactions that support practicing together during sessions.","communityKicker":"COMMUNITY INVOLVEMENT","communityTitle":"Sharing what I’ve learned.","communityClub":"First Skills Club Association","communityLocation":"Sfax, Tunisia","communityContext":"A Tunisian nonprofit where young people learn technology, English communication, and leadership through peer-led STEAM activities.","communitySupervisor":"3D Design Supervisor","communitySupervisorDates":"Aug 2022 — Aug 2025","communityCoach":"3D Design Coach","communityCoachDates":"Sep 2019 — Jun 2023","communityLink":"First Skills Club on LinkedIn"},"ar":{"languageLabel":"اللغة","navAbout":"نبذة","navWork":"العمل","navContact":"تواصل","intro":"أهلًا، أنا طه","heroTitle":"مهندس<br><span>Backend وAI.</span>","heroDescription":"أبني أنظمة Python للإنتاج وتجارب AI آنية وتطبيقات ذكية، من API إلى النشر.","connect":"تواصل معي","github":"GitHub","currentlyAt":"أعمل حاليًا في <a href=\"#work\">SpeakDuo</a>","role":"مهندس برمجيات","portraitNote":"أحوّل الأفكار إلى تجارب واقعية","aboutKicker":"نبذة عنّي","aboutTitle":"من يقف وراء الكود.","aboutText":"أنا طه الشلي، مهندس برمجيات من صفاقس في تونس. أستمتع بجميع مراحل بناء المنتج، من تصميم واجهة واضحة وتطوير backend موثوق إلى إضافة ميزات ذكية تجعله مفيدًا.","aboutDetail":"أنا خريج هندسة برمجيات، ولدي خبرة في تطوير Python backends وREST APIs وتطبيقات AI باستخدام FastAPI وSQL وDocker. ساهمت في تطوير ميزات مستخدمة فعليًا في SpeakDuo وأنجزت مشاريع AI متكاملة. أبحث عن وظيفة مطوّر Python بدوام كامل لبناء خدمات backend موثوقة والتطوّر في مجال AI engineering.","tagFullStack":"تطوير Full-stack","tagAI":"تطبيقات AI","tagRealtime":"تجارب آنية","workKicker":"ما أعمل عليه","workTitle":"أبني منتجات لها معنى.","current":"حاليًا","workHeading":"أساعد الناس على تعلّم اللغات،<br>محادثةً بعد محادثة.","workDescription":"أطوّر ميزات backend وAI لمنصة SpeakDuo لتعلّم اللغات المستخدمة في الإنتاج، عبر خدمات Python وتطبيق الويب وتجارب المحادثة الصوتية الآنية.","remote":"عن بُعد","toolkitTitle":"بعض الأدوات التي أستخدمها","contactKicker":"كل شيء جميل يبدأ بمحادثة","contactTitle":"لنصنع شيئًا<br><span>يستحق الحديث عنه.</span>","footerLine":"بُني بعناية. ويتطور دائمًا.","backToTop":"العودة إلى الأعلى ↑","navProjects":"المشاريع","projectsKicker":"مشاريع مختارة","projectsTitle":"أفكار أصبحت واقعًا.","viewProject":"اكتشف المشروع ↗","projectCategory":"التعرّف على الصوت · تعلّم آلي تطبيقي · FastAPI","projectSummary":"تعرّف على القارئ واكتشف الآية التي تسمعها. تطبيق للتعرّف على تلاوات القرآن الكريم، بالاستماع المباشر أو رفع ملف صوتي.","backProjects":"→ جميع المشاريع","liveDemo":"جرّب التطبيق","sourceCode":"الكود على GitHub","screenshotsKicker":"صور من التطبيق","screenshotsTitle":"طريقتان لاستكشاف التلاوة.","reciterCaption":"التعرّف على القارئ: ارفع تسجيلًا أو استمع مباشرةً.","verseCaption":"اكتشاف الآيات: اعثر على السورة والآية من التلاوة.","approachKicker":"كيف يعمل","approachTitle":"من الصوت إلى التعرّف على التلاوة.","reciterTitle":"التعرّف على القارئ","reciterDetail":"يولّد نموذج ECAPA-TDNN تمثيلًا للصوت عبر ONNX Runtime. تُنفّذ عملية inference، ثم تُستخدم cosine similarity لترتيب المطابقات مع الملفات الصوتية المرجعية لـ 20 قارئًا.","verseTitle":"العثور على الآية","verseDetail":"يحوّل نموذج Whisper المخصّص للقرآن الصوت العربي إلى نص، ثم يُقارَن النص بعد توحيده مع 6236 آية لتحديد السورة والآيات المحتملة.","contextTitle":"الاستماع إلى سياق أوسع","contextDetail":"عند التباس الآية، يجمع الاستماع التدريجي مزيدًا من الصوت لفهم السياق. وتظلّ النتائج غير المؤكّدة موسومة بوضوح.","stackKicker":"التقنيات","stackTitle":"التقنيات وراء التطبيق.","frontendDetail":"Frontend: React 19 وTypeScript باستخدام Vite وTailwind CSS 4. تتصل خاصية التسجيل بميكروفون المتصفح ورفع الملفات الصوتية بالـ API.","backendDetail":"Backend: Python وFastAPI مع WebSockets للتعرّف المباشر على القارئ. يتولى ONNX Runtime حساب speaker embeddings، ويستخدم faster-whisper وCTranslate2 لتحويل التلاوة إلى نص.","deployDetail":"النشر: Docker containers على Render، مع Nginx لتقديم frontend. يتحقق GitHub Actions من backend وfrontend قبل نشر الخدمات المعدّلة.","tryTitle":"استمع. واكتشف.","qafiyaCategory":"معالجة العربية · خوارزميات · CPU AI","qafiyaSummary":"ورشة للشعر العربي تستكشف الوزن الخليلي والقافية والتقطيع وإكمال التشكيل محليًا.","qafiyaCaptionDesk":"مساحة الكتابة — اختر بحرًا ورويًا، ثم استكشف إيقاع البيت.","qafiyaCaptionMobile":"تحليل للشعر العربي بواجهة ملائمة للهاتف.","qafiyaApproachTitle":"من البيت المكتوب إلى إيقاعه.","qafiyaAnalysisTitle":"تحليل البحور الشعرية","qafiyaAnalysisDetail":"افحص الأبيات وفق 16 بحرًا خليليًا باستخدام PyArud. استكشف الصدر والعجز والتقطيع الثنائي والتفعيلات والروي المطلوب.","qafiyaTashkeelTitle":"إكمال التشكيل محليًا","qafiyaTashkeelDetail":"يُكمل نموذج libtashkeel ONNX المضمّن، بحجم 4.8 MB، الحركات الناقصة على CPU. يبقى التشكيل المزوّد معتمدًا، ولا يستدعي التحليل أي LLM.","qafiyaDraftTitle":"التوليد ما يزال تجريبيًا","qafiyaDraftDetail":"يمكن لمزوّد اختياري صياغة القصائد ومراجعة الأبيات غير المطابقة مع الحفاظ على النص السليم. التوليد معطّل حاليًا في النسخة العامة.","qafiyaFrontend":"Frontend: React 19 وTypeScript وVite، بواجهة عربية متجاوبة تدعم RTL.","qafiyaBackend":"Backend: Python 3.12 وFastAPI وPyArud وNumPy وONNX Runtime على CPU. يستخدم worker واحد جلسة inference مشتركة ومحدودة.","qafiyaDeploy":"الاستضافة: frontend على Cloudflare Pages وAPI داخل Docker على Render. يتحقق GitHub Actions من frontend وbackend وصورة production.","qafiyaTryTitle":"استكشف الوزن والقافية.","generationPaused":"تحليل الأبيات متاح في النسخة التجريبية على الموقع. التوليد باستخدام AI معطّل حاليًا.","downloadCV":"تنزيل السيرة الذاتية","contactIntent":"مقيم في تونس · منفتح على فرص دولية عن بُعد في Backend وAI.","employmentDates":"مهندس برمجيات · يوليو 2026 — الآن","internshipDates":"سابقًا: تدريب نهاية الدراسة في SpeakDuo · يناير — يوليو 2026.","achievementFeedback":"تطوير ملاحظات متعددة اللغات حول القواعد والنطق لمساعدة المتعلّمين على مراجعة محادثاتهم وفهم الأخطاء وتحديد ما يحتاجون إلى التدرب عليه.","achievementVoice":"دمج النصوص المصاحبة المباشرة والترجمة والمقابلات الصوتية مع AI لدعم ممارسة المحادثة بلغات متعددة وتسهيل متابعة التفاعلات المنطوقة.","writingKicker":"دفتر الهندسة","writingTitle":"شرح القرارات التقنية.","decisionsKicker":"التحديات والموازنات","decisionsTitle":"لماذا هذه الخيارات التقنية؟","readNote":"اقرأ الملاحظة الهندسية","cvFormat":"PDF · 129 KB","story0Title":"حين يحتاج التعرّف على التلاوة إلى سياق أطول","story0Summary":"فصل التعرّف على صوت القارئ عن تحديد الآية، وإظهار عدم اليقين ضمن تجربة الاستماع.","story0Section0Title":"سؤالان ومساران مختلفان","story0Section0Text":"التعرّف على صوت القارئ والتعرّف على الكلمات مسألتان مختلفتان. يستخدم Quranic Shazam تقنية speaker embeddings من ECAPA-TDNN عبر ONNX Runtime لترتيب المطابقات مع الملفات الصوتية المرجعية لـ 20 قارئًا. أما تحديد الآية فيعتمد على نموذج Whisper مكيّف للقرآن، ثم توحيد صيغة النص العربي ومقارنته بـ 6,236 آية. يُستخدم نموذج speaker embeddings بحالته pretrained، دون fine-tuning على تسجيلات قرآنية.","story0Section1Title":"جمع سياق إضافي قبل الجزم بالنتيجة","story0Section1Text":"قد يتوافق مقطع قصير مع أكثر من آية. يضيف الاستماع التدريجي سياقًا صوتيًا حتى حدّ أقصى يبلغ 60 ثانية، وتظل النتائج الملتبسة موسومة بأنها غير مؤكدة. يتيح هذا الاختيار جمع سياق أوسع مقابل وقت استماع أطول، بدلًا من فرض إجابة مبكرة.","story0Section2Title":"تنفيذ inference خارج event loop","story0Section2Text":"تُنفّذ عملية inference خارج event loop الخاصة بالـ API غير المتزامنة. يقتصر حجم الملف المرفوع على 25 MB، مع حدود زمنية للصوت تختلف بحسب وضع التعرّف. تضبط هذه الحدود تكلفة الطلبات، مع دعم رفع الملفات والاستماع المباشر عبر الميكروفون.","story0Section3Title":"قياس مهمة محددة بوضوح","story0Section3Text":"سجّل التقييم offline بتاريخ 5 سبتمبر 2026 دقة 97.31% في top-1 و99.10% في top-3 لتحديد القارئ، على 781 مقطعًا مخصّصًا للتقييم، مع فصل سور بناء الملفات الصوتية عن سور الاختبار. تصف هذه الأرقام ذلك benchmark لتحديد القارئ فقط؛ ولا تقيس تحديد الآيات أو تضمن الأداء مع مختلف الميكروفونات والضجيج والتسجيلات.","story1Title":"تحليل العَروض العربي على خادم CPU صغير","story1Summary":"نموذج تشكيل بحجم 4.8 MB، مع الحفاظ على الحركات الموجودة وتوضيح حدود التحليل الآلي.","story1Section0Title":"اختيار نموذج يناسب موارد الاستضافة","story1Section0Text":"يجمع Qafiya بين تحليل العَروض الخليلي باستخدام PyArud ونموذج libtashkeel ONNX مضمّن بحجم يقارب 4.8 MB. يعمل التشكيل محليًا على CPU دون PyTorch أو Transformers أو GPU أو خادم نماذج خارجي. يستخدم Uvicorn worker واحد جلسة inference مشتركة ومحدودة، تُنفّذ الطلبات بالتتابع لضبط عدد نسخ النموذج وعمليات التنفيذ المتزامنة.","story1Section1Title":"الحفاظ على نص الكاتب","story1Section1Text":"تبقى الحركات الموجودة في النص هي المرجع. يُكمل التشكيل التلقائي الحركات الناقصة ويوضّح التغييرات؛ وتعرض الواجهة النص الذي جرى تحليله مع إبقاء النص الأصلي متاحًا. هذا الفرق مهم لأن التقطيع يعتمد على النطق، وقد تغيّر حركة متوقّعة نتيجة التحليل.","story1Section2Title":"اختبار container وتوضيح حدود النتائج","story1Section2Text":"شغّل الاختبار المحلي الموثّق صورة production على مستوى تطبيق ASGI كاملًا، ضمن حدّ 512 MiB من RAM و0.1 CPU. بلغت ذروة process RSS مقدار 142.55 MiB دون حدوث out-of-memory. هذه نتيجة لحمل محدّد، وليست ضمانًا للأداء مع أي حجم من الزيارات العامة. وفي عيّنة منفصلة من 12 بيتًا، تحسّنت مطابقة الوزن للنصوص المشكلة جزئيًا من 2/12 إلى 10/12، بينما لم تتجاوز النصوص الخالية تمامًا من علامات التشكيل 2/12.","story1Section3Title":"حصر المراجعة والحفاظ على الأجزاء السليمة","story1Section3Text":"يفحص workflow التجريبي الوزن والروي المطلوب، ثم يراجع الأبيات غير المطابقة ضمن حلقة محدودة. يحافظ backend على الأبيات المقبولة والأشطر السليمة. تطابق الروي أضيق من التحقق الكامل من القافية الخليلية، والقبول الآلي لا يثبت الجودة الأدبية. يبقى توليد AI معطّلًا في النسخة العامة.","notebookTitle":"دفتر الهندسة","allNotes":"العودة إلى الملاحظات","noteLabel":"ملاحظة هندسية","readingTime":"3 دقائق للقراءة","articleContext":"شرح للخيارات التقنية والنتائج الموثّقة في مستودع المشروع.","contentsLabel":"في هذه المقالة","sourcesTitle":"المصادر والتنفيذ","sourceReadme":"README المشروع","sourceEvidence":"التقييم والنتائج","exploreProject":"استكشف المشروع","continueReading":"تابع القراءة","writtenBy":"بقلم","evidenceCaption":"استنادًا إلى README المشروع والتقييمات المرتبطة به.","copyLink":"نسخ الرابط","linkCopied":"تم نسخ الرابط","switchDark":"تفعيل المظهر الداكن","switchLight":"تفعيل المظهر الفاتح","opensNewTab":"يفتح في علامة تبويب جديدة","technologyLabel":"التقنيات","contactLinksLabel":"التواصل والحسابات الاجتماعية","homeLabel":"الصفحة الرئيسية لطه الشلي","browseNotebook":"تصفّح دفتر الهندسة","navNotebook":"الدفتر","sectionLink":"رابط هذا القسم","projectSectionsLabel":"أقسام المشروع","projectScreenshots":"الصور","projectArchitecture":"آلية العمل","projectDecisions":"القرارات","reciterScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam: شاشة التعرّف على القارئ","verseScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam: شاشة اكتشاف الآيات","qafiyaDesktopAlt":"Qafiya: تحليل الشعر العربي على الحاسوب","qafiyaMobileAlt":"Qafiya: تحليل الشعر العربي على الهاتف","remoteOpportunity":"مقيم في تونس · منفتح على فرص دولية عن بُعد في Backend وAI.","exploreProjects":"استكشف المشاريع","reciterEvidenceContext":"التعرّف على القارئ · تقييم دون اتصال على 781 مقطعًا محجوزًا؛ لا يقيس التعرّف على الآيات.","qafiyaEvidenceContext":"حمل محلي داخل حاوية · ذروة RSS للعملية 142.55 MiB ضمن سقف 512 MiB RAM؛ ليس اختبارًا لحركة الاستخدام العام.","reciterEvidence":"97.31% top-1 · 99.10% top-3","qafiyaEvidence":"4.8 MB · CPU ONNX","achievementPractice":"بناء تتبّع المفردات وتمارين المراجعة والتدريب الشخصي على القواعد لإعادة ممارسة الكلمات والتراكيب الواردة في محادثات المتعلّمين.","achievementMultiplayer":"تقديم دردشة AI وأنشطة تعلّم جماعية متزامنة، بربط خدمات backend بالتجارب التفاعلية في تطبيق الويب.","speakduoCaseLabel":"دراسة حالة","speakduoCaseTitle":"تحويل المحادثات إلى فرص للتعلّم.","speakduoCaseSummary":"دردشة AI ومحتوى تعليمي متعدد اللغات وأدوات مفردات وتدريب تفاعلي: مساهمات مختارة في SpeakDuo.","speakduoCaseLink":"اقرأ دراسة حالة SpeakDuo","speakduoCaseBack":"← العودة إلى الخبرة","speakduoCaseContextTitle":"حاجة المتعلّم","speakduoCaseContext":"أعمل في SpeakDuo على ميزات تعلّم اللغات في backend وتطبيق الويب. تصف هذه الأمثلة مساهمات مختارة من عملي المدمج، وتشمل دردشة AI والمحتوى والتدريب الشخصي والأنشطة الجماعية.","speakduoCasePracticeTitle":"التدريب الشخصي","speakduoCasePractice":"نفّذت مراجعة العبارات بتكرار مجدول وساهمت في الأرشيف الشخصي للقواعد. يستطيع المتعلّمون مراجعة أمثلة التصحيحات وحفظ التدريبات واستئناف الجلسات غير المكتملة ومتابعة تقدّمهم.","speakduoCaseRoleTitle":"مساهمتي","speakduoCaseRole":"تشمل مساهماتي خدمات backend بلغة Python وواجهات React والتكامل والاختبارات وإصلاح السلوك القائم. عملت وفق أساليب الفريق في المنتج والهندسة، وتعاملت مع المراجعات وتحققت من سلوك الميزات.","speakduoCaseChatTitle":"روبوت محادثة AI","speakduoCaseChat":"طوّرت دردشة Ash المدعومة بـ AI في backend وتطبيق الويب، بما يشمل سجل المحادثات والردود التدريجية وإدارة النقاشات. وعملت أيضًا على جعل توصيات المساعد تتوافق مع ميزات التعلّم الموجودة فعليًا على المنصة.","speakduoCaseVoiceTitle":"الوكيل الصوتي لمقابلات AI والملاحظات","speakduoCaseVoice":"عملت على دعم اللغات المتعددة للوكيل الصوتي لمقابلات AI وعلى ملاحظات القواعد والنطق. كما حسّنت معالجة النصوص المصاحبة المباشرة وعدّلت الملاحظات للتمييز بين التعبيرات اليومية المنطوقة والأخطاء الفعلية.","speakduoCoverAlt":"غلاف دراسة حالة SpeakDuo: المحادثة والصوت والتدريب ممثلة بفقاعات كلام وموجة صوتية وكتاب.","speakduoCaseLessonsTitle":"محتوى تعليمي باستخدام AI التوليدي","speakduoCaseLessons":"وسّعت توليد الدروس باستخدام AI ليدعم لغات متعددة، وعملت على القصص والحوارات وتمارين القواعد المولّدة. وشمل ذلك تحسين الأمثلة لتكون مفهومة دون سياق خارجي وتساعد على ممارسة الكلمات والتعبيرات ضمن سياق.","speakduoCaseVocabularyTitle":"أدوات المفردات والقراءة","speakduoCaseVocabulary":"بنيت ميزات تتبّع المفردات ومراجعتها، ومنها الكلمات المحفوظة وسجل الترجمات والبحث عن معاني الكلمات. وعملت على تجارب قراءة لقصص مولّدة ومقالات مستوردة مع تمارين إكمال الكلمات واختبارات القواعد.","speakduoCaseActivitiesTitle":"أنشطة جماعية تفاعلية","speakduoCaseActivities":"نفّذت أنشطة تعلّم تشمل مسابقات المعلومات وMissing Word وWord Connect واستطلاعات التفضيلات. شملت مساهماتي ميزات الأنشطة وأدوات تحكّم المضيف وتفاعلات المتعلّمين للممارسة معًا خلال الجلسات.","communityKicker":"المشاركة المجتمعية","communityTitle":"أشارك ما تعلّمته.","communityClub":"جمعية First Skills Club","communityLocation":"صفاقس، تونس","communityContext":"جمعية تونسية يتعلّم فيها الشباب التكنولوجيا والتواصل بالإنجليزية والقيادة عبر أنشطة العلوم والتكنولوجيا والهندسة والفنون والرياضيات التي يقودها أقرانهم.","communitySupervisor":"مشرف على التصميم ثلاثي الأبعاد","communitySupervisorDates":"أغسطس 2022 — أغسطس 2025","communityCoach":"مدرّب في التصميم ثلاثي الأبعاد","communityCoachDates":"سبتمبر 2019 — يونيو 2023","communityLink":"First Skills Club على LinkedIn"},"es":{"languageLabel":"Idioma","navAbout":"Sobre mí","navWork":"Trabajo","navContact":"Contacto","intro":"HOLA, SOY TAHA","heroTitle":"Ingeniero<br><span>Backend & AI.</span>","heroDescription":"Desarrollo sistemas Python en producción, experiencias AI en tiempo real y aplicaciones inteligentes, desde las API hasta el despliegue.","connect":"Hablemos","github":"GitHub","currentlyAt":"Actualmente en <a href=\"#work\">SpeakDuo</a>","role":"Ingeniero de software","portraitNote":"Convierto ideas en experiencias reales","aboutKicker":"UN POCO DE CONTEXTO","aboutTitle":"La persona detrás del código.","aboutText":"Soy Taha Chelly, ingeniero de software en Sfax, Túnez. Me gusta acompañar cada etapa de un producto: desde una interfaz clara y un backend fiable hasta la inteligencia que lo hace realmente útil.","aboutDetail":"Soy graduado en ingeniería de software con experiencia en backends Python, API REST y aplicaciones de AI con FastAPI, SQL y Docker. He contribuido a funciones en producción de SpeakDuo y desarrollado proyectos de AI de principio a fin. Busco un puesto de desarrollador Python a tiempo completo para crear servicios backend fiables y crecer en ingeniería de AI.","tagFullStack":"Desarrollo full-stack","tagAI":"Aplicaciones de AI","tagRealtime":"Experiencias en tiempo real","workKicker":"EN QUÉ ESTOY TRABAJANDO","workTitle":"Crear con propósito.","current":"Puesto actual","workHeading":"Ayudo a las personas a aprender idiomas.<br>Una conversación cada vez.","workDescription":"Desarrollo funciones backend y AI para la plataforma de idiomas SpeakDuo en producción, trabajando con servicios Python, la aplicación web y experiencias de voz en tiempo real.","remote":"Remoto","toolkitTitle":"Algunas herramientas que uso","contactKicker":"LAS BUENAS IDEAS EMPIEZAN CON UNA CONVERSACIÓN","contactTitle":"Creemos algo<br><span>que merezca la pena compartir.</span>","footerLine":"Hecho con cuidado. En constante evolución.","backToTop":"Volver arriba ↑","navProjects":"Proyectos","projectsKicker":"PROYECTOS SELECCIONADOS","projectsTitle":"Ideas que cobran vida.","viewProject":"Explorar el proyecto ↗","projectCategory":"RECONOCIMIENTO DE AUDIO · ML APLICADO · FastAPI","projectSummary":"Descubre quién recita y qué aleya estás escuchando. Reconocimiento de recitaciones del Corán, en directo o mediante archivos de audio.","backProjects":"← Todos los proyectos","liveDemo":"Probar la demo","sourceCode":"Ver en GitHub","screenshotsKicker":"EN IMÁGENES","screenshotsTitle":"Dos formas de explorar una recitación.","reciterCaption":"Reconocimiento del recitador: sube audio o escucha en directo.","verseCaption":"Búsqueda de aleyas: encuentra la sura y la aleya recitadas.","approachKicker":"CÓMO FUNCIONA","approachTitle":"Del sonido a la identificación.","reciterTitle":"Identificar al recitador","reciterDetail":"El modelo ECAPA-TDNN genera un voice embedding. ONNX Runtime ejecuta el proceso de inference y la cosine similarity ordena las coincidencias con los perfiles de 20 recitadores.","verseTitle":"Encontrar la aleya","verseDetail":"Un modelo Whisper adaptado al Corán transcribe el audio árabe. El texto normalizado se compara con 6236 aleyas para encontrar las coincidencias probables.","contextTitle":"Escuchar más contexto","contextDetail":"Si la coincidencia es ambigua, la escucha progresiva añade más audio. Los resultados inciertos se indican como tales.","stackKicker":"TECNOLOGÍAS","stackTitle":"La tecnología del proyecto.","frontendDetail":"Frontend: React 19 y TypeScript, con Vite y Tailwind CSS 4. La captura de audio del navegador y la subida de archivos se conectan a la API.","backendDetail":"Backend: Python y FastAPI, con WebSockets para identificar recitadores en directo. ONNX Runtime calcula los speaker embeddings; faster-whisper y CTranslate2 transcriben las recitaciones.","deployDetail":"Despliegue: Docker containers en Render, con Nginx para servir el frontend. GitHub Actions comprueba el backend y el frontend antes de desplegar los servicios modificados.","tryTitle":"Escucha. Descubre.","qafiyaCategory":"NLP ÁRABE · ALGORITMOS · CPU AI","qafiyaSummary":"Un taller de poesía árabe para explorar métrica clásica, rima, escansión y vocalización local.","qafiyaCaptionDesk":"Espacio de escritura — elige un metro clásico y una letra de rima, y después examina el verso.","qafiyaCaptionMobile":"Análisis de poesía árabe adaptado al móvil.","qafiyaApproachTitle":"Del verso escrito a su ritmo.","qafiyaAnalysisTitle":"Analiza los metros clásicos","qafiyaAnalysisDetail":"Comprueba los versos árabes con 16 metros clásicos mediante PyArud. Explora ambos hemistiquios, la escansión binaria, los pies y la letra de rima solicitada (rawi).","qafiyaTashkeelTitle":"Completa la vocalización localmente","qafiyaTashkeelDetail":"Un modelo libtashkeel ONNX incluido de unos 4.8 MB completa los signos vocálicos que faltan en la CPU. Respeta los signos existentes y analiza sin llamar a un LLM.","qafiyaDraftTitle":"La generación es experimental","qafiyaDraftDetail":"Un proveedor opcional redacta poemas y revisa los versos que fallan sin cambiar el texto aceptado. La generación está desactivada en la demo pública.","qafiyaFrontend":"Frontend: React 19, TypeScript y Vite, con una interfaz árabe adaptable de derecha a izquierda.","qafiyaBackend":"Backend: Python 3.12, FastAPI, PyArud, NumPy y ONNX Runtime para CPU. Un único worker comparte una sesión de inference con uso limitado.","qafiyaDeploy":"Alojamiento: frontend en Cloudflare Pages y API Docker en Render. GitHub Actions comprueba el frontend, el backend y el container de producción.","qafiyaTryTitle":"Explora la métrica y la rima.","generationPaused":"El análisis está disponible en la demo. La generación con AI está desactivada.","cvFormat":"PDF · 129 KB","story0Title":"Cuando un fragmento de audio necesita más contexto","story0Summary":"Separar la identificación del recitador de la búsqueda de aleyas e integrar la incertidumbre en la experiencia de escucha.","story0Section0Title":"Dos preguntas, dos pipelines","story0Section0Text":"Reconocer una voz y reconocer palabras son problemas distintos. Quranic Shazam utiliza speaker embeddings ECAPA-TDNN con ONNX Runtime para ordenar las coincidencias con 20 perfiles de recitadores. La búsqueda de aleyas usa un modelo Whisper adaptado al Corán, normaliza la transcripción árabe y la compara con 6.236 aleyas. El modelo de speaker embeddings se utiliza en su estado pretrained, sin fine-tuning con grabaciones del Corán.","story0Section1Title":"Pedir más contexto antes de dar una respuesta segura","story0Section1Text":"Una recitación breve puede coincidir con varias aleyas. La escucha progresiva añade contexto de audio hasta un límite de 60 segundos, y los resultados ambiguos siguen marcados como inciertos. Se acepta una espera mayor a cambio de más contexto, en lugar de forzar una respuesta temprana.","story0Section2Title":"Ejecutar inference fuera del event loop","story0Section2Text":"El proceso de inference del modelo se ejecuta fuera del event loop asíncrono de la API. Los archivos están limitados a 25 MB y cada modo tiene su propio límite de duración. Estas restricciones acotan las solicitudes costosas mientras la API admite archivos y sesiones de micrófono en directo.","story0Section3Title":"Medir una tarea bien definida","story0Section3Text":"La evaluación offline del 5 de septiembre de 2026 obtuvo un 97,31 % en top-1 y un 99,10 % en top-3 para identificar recitadores en 781 fragmentos reservados para evaluación, con suras distintas para crear perfiles y evaluar. Estas cifras describen ese benchmark de recitadores; no miden la identificación de aleyas ni garantizan resultados con cualquier micrófono, ruido o grabación.","story1Title":"Prosodia árabe en un pequeño servidor con CPU","story1Summary":"Un modelo de vocalización de 4.8 MB, respeto por los signos vocálicos existentes y límites claros para el análisis automático.","story1Section0Title":"Ajustar el modelo a los recursos disponibles","story1Section0Text":"Qafiya combina el análisis de prosodia clásica de PyArud con un modelo libtashkeel ONNX incluido de unos 4.8 MB. La vocalización se ejecuta localmente en CPU sin PyTorch, Transformers, GPU ni servidor externo de modelos. Un único Uvicorn worker comparte una sesión de inference acotada y serializada para controlar las copias del modelo y las ejecuciones simultáneas.","story1Section1Title":"Respetar el texto del autor","story1Section1Text":"Los signos vocálicos existentes tienen prioridad. La vocalización automática completa los signos que faltan e informa de los cambios; la interfaz muestra el texto analizado y conserva el original. Esta distinción importa porque la escansión depende de la pronunciación y una vocal predicha puede cambiar el resultado.","story1Section2Title":"Probar el container y explicar los límites","story1Section2Text":"La prueba local documentada ejecutó la imagen de producción con una carga que abarca la aplicación ASGI, bajo límites de 512 MiB de RAM y 0.1 CPU. El process RSS alcanzó 142.55 MiB sin errores out-of-memory. Es evidencia de una carga acotada, no una garantía para cualquier tráfico público. En otra muestra de 12 versos, las coincidencias métricas de textos parcialmente vocalizados mejoraron de 2/12 a 10/12; los textos completamente desprovistos de signos vocálicos solo alcanzaron 2/12.","story1Section3Title":"Acotar las revisiones y conservar el texto válido","story1Section3Text":"El workflow experimental comprueba la métrica y el rawi solicitado, y revisa los versos que fallan mediante un bucle limitado. El backend conserva los versos aceptados y los hemistiquios válidos. La igualdad del rawi no equivale a validar toda la rima clásica, y la aceptación automática no certifica calidad literaria. La generación con AI sigue desactivada en la demo pública.","notebookTitle":"Cuaderno de ingeniería","readNote":"Leer la nota técnica","allNotes":"Volver a las notas","noteLabel":"Nota técnica","readingTime":"3 min de lectura","articleContext":"Un recorrido por las decisiones técnicas y los resultados documentados en el repositorio del proyecto.","contentsLabel":"En este artículo","sourcesTitle":"Fuentes e implementación","sourceReadme":"README del proyecto","sourceEvidence":"Evaluación y resultados","exploreProject":"Explorar el proyecto","continueReading":"Seguir leyendo","writtenBy":"Por","writingTitle":"Las decisiones técnicas, explicadas.","evidenceCaption":"Basado en el README del proyecto y las evaluaciones enlazadas.","copyLink":"Copiar enlace","linkCopied":"Enlace copiado","writingKicker":"Cuaderno de ingeniería","downloadCV":"Descargar CV","contactIntent":"Desde Túnez · Abierto a puestos internacionales remotos en Backend & AI.","employmentDates":"Ingeniero de software · Jul. 2026 — Actualidad","internshipDates":"Anteriormente: prácticas de fin de carrera en SpeakDuo · Ene. — Jul. 2026.","achievementFeedback":"Desarrollar comentarios multilingües sobre gramática y pronunciación para que los estudiantes revisen sus conversaciones, comprendan errores y decidan qué practicar después.","achievementVoice":"Integrar subtítulos en directo, traducción y entrevistas de voz con AI para practicar conversaciones en varios idiomas y seguir mejor las interacciones habladas.","decisionsKicker":"RETOS Y DECISIONES","decisionsTitle":"Por qué funciona así.","switchDark":"Activar el tema oscuro","switchLight":"Activar el tema claro","opensNewTab":"Se abre en una pestaña nueva","technologyLabel":"Tecnologías","contactLinksLabel":"Contacto y redes sociales","homeLabel":"Inicio de Taha Chelly","browseNotebook":"Explorar el cuaderno","navNotebook":"Cuaderno","sectionLink":"Enlace a esta sección","projectSectionsLabel":"Secciones del proyecto","projectScreenshots":"Capturas","projectArchitecture":"Cómo funciona","projectDecisions":"Decisiones","reciterScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam: pantalla de reconocimiento del recitador","verseScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam: pantalla de búsqueda de aleyas","qafiyaDesktopAlt":"Qafiya: análisis de poesía árabe en ordenador","qafiyaMobileAlt":"Qafiya: análisis de poesía árabe en móvil","remoteOpportunity":"Desde Túnez · Abierto a puestos internacionales remotos en Backend & AI.","exploreProjects":"Explorar proyectos","reciterEvidenceContext":"Reconocimiento del recitador · evaluación sin conexión con 781 clips reservados; no mide la identificación de versículos.","qafiyaEvidenceContext":"Carga local en contenedor · RSS máximo del proceso de 142.55 MiB con un límite de 512 MiB RAM; no mide tráfico público.","reciterEvidence":"97.31% top-1 · 99.10% top-3","qafiyaEvidence":"4.8 MB · CPU ONNX","achievementPractice":"Crear seguimiento de vocabulario, ejercicios de repaso y práctica gramatical personalizada para retomar palabras y estructuras de las conversaciones.","achievementMultiplayer":"Ofrecer chat AI y actividades grupales sincronizadas, conectando los servicios backend con experiencias interactivas en la aplicación web.","speakduoCaseLabel":"CASO DE ESTUDIO","speakduoCaseTitle":"Convertir conversaciones en oportunidades de aprendizaje.","speakduoCaseSummary":"Chat AI, contenido multilingüe, herramientas de vocabulario y práctica interactiva: contribuciones seleccionadas en SpeakDuo.","speakduoCaseLink":"Leer el caso de SpeakDuo","speakduoCaseBack":"← Volver a la experiencia","speakduoCaseContextTitle":"La necesidad del estudiante","speakduoCaseContext":"En SpeakDuo desarrollo funciones de idiomas en el backend y la aplicación web. Estos ejemplos describen contribuciones integradas: chat AI, contenido, práctica personal y actividades grupales.","speakduoCasePracticeTitle":"Práctica personal","speakduoCasePractice":"Implementé el repaso de frases con repetición programada y contribuí al archivo personal de gramática. Los estudiantes pueden revisar correcciones, guardar ejercicios, retomar sesiones y consultar su progreso.","speakduoCaseRoleTitle":"Mi contribución","speakduoCaseRole":"Mis contribuciones abarcan servicios backend Python, interfaces React, integración, pruebas y correcciones. Trabajé con las convenciones del equipo, atendiendo revisiones y comprobando el comportamiento de las funciones.","speakduoCaseChatTitle":"Chatbot AI","speakduoCaseChat":"Desarrollé el chat AI de Ash en el backend y la aplicación web, con historial, respuestas progresivas y gestión de conversaciones. También trabajé para que el asistente recomiende funciones que realmente existen en la plataforma.","speakduoCaseVoiceTitle":"Agente de voz para entrevistas AI y comentarios","speakduoCaseVoice":"Trabajé en el soporte multilingüe del agente de voz para entrevistas AI y en los comentarios de gramática y pronunciación. También mejoré el procesamiento de subtítulos y adapté los comentarios para distinguir expresiones orales cotidianas de errores reales.","speakduoCoverAlt":"Portada de SpeakDuo: conversación, voz y práctica con bocadillos, una onda de audio y un libro.","speakduoCaseLessonsTitle":"Contenido educativo con AI generativa","speakduoCaseLessons":"Amplié la generación de lecciones AI con soporte multilingüe y trabajé en historias, diálogos y ejercicios gramaticales generados. Mejoré ejemplos para que se entiendan por sí solos y ayuden a practicar palabras y expresiones en contexto.","speakduoCaseVocabularyTitle":"Vocabulario y lectura","speakduoCaseVocabulary":"Construí funciones de seguimiento y repaso de vocabulario: palabras guardadas, historial de traducciones y consulta de significados. También trabajé en lectura con historias generadas y artículos importados, ejercicios de completar palabras y cuestionarios de gramática.","speakduoCaseActivitiesTitle":"Actividades grupales interactivas","speakduoCaseActivities":"Implementé actividades como trivia, Missing Word, Word Connect y encuestas de preferencias. Mis contribuciones incluyeron funciones de actividad, controles para anfitriones e interacciones para practicar juntos durante las sesiones.","communityKicker":"PARTICIPACIÓN COMUNITARIA","communityTitle":"Compartir lo que he aprendido.","communityClub":"Asociación First Skills Club","communityLocation":"Sfax, Túnez","communityContext":"Una asociación tunecina sin ánimo de lucro donde los jóvenes aprenden tecnología, comunicación en inglés y liderazgo mediante actividades STEAM guiadas por sus compañeros.","communitySupervisor":"Supervisor de diseño 3D","communitySupervisorDates":"Ago. 2022 — ago. 2025","communityCoach":"Formador de diseño 3D","communityCoachDates":"Sept. 2019 — jun. 2023","communityLink":"First Skills Club en LinkedIn"},"de":{"languageLabel":"Sprache","navAbout":"Über mich","navWork":"Arbeit","navContact":"Kontakt","intro":"HALLO, ICH BIN TAHA","heroTitle":"Backend & AI<br><span>Engineer.</span>","heroDescription":"Ich entwickle Python-Systeme für den Produktivbetrieb, AI-Erlebnisse in Echtzeit und intelligente Anwendungen — von API bis Deployment.","connect":"Lass uns sprechen","github":"GitHub","currentlyAt":"Derzeit bei <a href=\"#work\">SpeakDuo</a>","role":"Softwareentwickler","portraitNote":"Ich mache aus Ideen echte Erlebnisse","aboutKicker":"KURZ ZU MIR","aboutTitle":"Der Mensch hinter dem Code.","aboutText":"Ich bin Taha Chelly, Softwareentwickler aus Sfax in Tunesien. Mir gefällt der gesamte Weg von der ersten Idee bis zum fertigen Produkt: eine klare Oberfläche, ein zuverlässiges Backend und die passende Intelligenz, die es nützlich macht.","aboutDetail":"Ich bin Absolvent der Softwaretechnik mit Erfahrung in Python-Backends, REST-APIs und AI-Anwendungen mit FastAPI, SQL und Docker. Bei SpeakDuo habe ich an produktiv eingesetzten Funktionen mitgewirkt und eigene AI-Projekte von Anfang bis Ende umgesetzt. Ich suche eine Vollzeitstelle als Python-Entwickler, um zuverlässige Backend-Dienste zu entwickeln und mich im AI-Engineering weiterzuentwickeln.","tagFullStack":"Full-Stack-Entwicklung","tagAI":"AI-Anwendungen","tagRealtime":"Echtzeiterlebnisse","workKicker":"WORAN ICH ARBEITE","workTitle":"Produkte mit Mehrwert entwickeln.","current":"Aktuell","workHeading":"Ich helfe Menschen, Sprachen zu lernen.<br>Gespräch für Gespräch.","workDescription":"Ich entwickle backend- und AI-Funktionen für die produktive Sprachlernplattform SpeakDuo, mit Python-Diensten, der Web-App und Spracherlebnissen in Echtzeit.","remote":"Remote","toolkitTitle":"Einige Tools, mit denen ich arbeite","contactKicker":"GUTE IDEEN BEGINNEN MIT EINEM GESPRÄCH","contactTitle":"Lass uns etwas schaffen,<br><span>über das man gern spricht.</span>","footerLine":"Mit Sorgfalt entwickelt. Immer im Wandel.","backToTop":"Nach oben ↑","navProjects":"Projekte","projectsKicker":"AUSGEWÄHLTE PROJEKTE","projectsTitle":"Ideen werden Wirklichkeit.","viewProject":"Projekt entdecken ↗","projectCategory":"AUDIOERKENNUNG · ANGEWANDTES ML · FastAPI","projectSummary":"Erkenne den Rezitator und finde den Vers, den du hörst. Eine App zur Erkennung von Koranrezitationen mit Live-Aufnahme und Audio-Upload.","backProjects":"← Alle Projekte","liveDemo":"Live-Demo ausprobieren","sourceCode":"Auf GitHub ansehen","screenshotsKicker":"EINBLICKE","screenshotsTitle":"Zwei Wege, eine Rezitation zu entdecken.","reciterCaption":"Rezitator erkennen: Audiodatei hochladen oder live zuhören.","verseCaption":"Verse finden: Sure und Vers einer Rezitation bestimmen.","approachKicker":"SO FUNKTIONIERT ES","approachTitle":"Vom Klang zum passenden Treffer.","reciterTitle":"Rezitator erkennen","reciterDetail":"Das ECAPA-TDNN-Modell erzeugt ein Voice Embedding. ONNX Runtime führt die Inference aus; anschließend ordnet Cosine Similarity die Treffer anhand der Profile von 20 Rezitatoren.","verseTitle":"Vers finden","verseDetail":"Ein auf den Koran abgestimmtes Whisper-Modell transkribiert arabische Aufnahmen. Der normalisierte Text wird mit 6.236 Versen verglichen.","contextTitle":"Mehr Kontext hören","contextDetail":"Bei mehrdeutigen Versen sammelt die schrittweise Aufnahme mehr Kontext. Unsichere Ergebnisse bleiben entsprechend gekennzeichnet.","stackKicker":"TECHNOLOGIEN","stackTitle":"Die Technik dahinter.","frontendDetail":"Frontend: React 19, TypeScript, Vite und Tailwind CSS 4. Browsermikrofon und Audio-Uploads sind mit der API verbunden.","backendDetail":"Backend: Python und FastAPI mit WebSockets zur Live-Erkennung von Rezitatoren. ONNX Runtime berechnet Speaker Embeddings; faster-whisper und CTranslate2 transkribieren die Rezitationen.","deployDetail":"Bereitstellung: Docker-Container auf Render, mit Nginx für das Frontend. GitHub Actions prüft Backend und Frontend, bevor geänderte Dienste bereitgestellt werden.","tryTitle":"Hören. Entdecken.","qafiyaCategory":"ARABISCHES NLP · ALGORITHMEN · CPU AI","qafiyaSummary":"Eine Werkstatt für arabische Poesie mit klassischem Versmaß, Reim, Skansion und lokaler Vokalisierung.","qafiyaCaptionDesk":"Schreibbereich — klassisches Versmaß und Reimbuchstaben wählen und anschließend den Vers untersuchen.","qafiyaCaptionMobile":"Arabische Versanalyse im mobilfreundlichen Layout.","qafiyaApproachTitle":"Vom geschriebenen Vers zu seinem Rhythmus.","qafiyaAnalysisTitle":"Klassisches Versmaß analysieren","qafiyaAnalysisDetail":"Prüfe arabische Verse mit PyArud anhand von 16 klassischen Metren. Untersuche beide Halbverse, die binäre Skansion, die Versfüße und den gewünschten Reimbuchstaben (rawi).","qafiyaTashkeelTitle":"Vokalisierung lokal ergänzen","qafiyaTashkeelDetail":"Ein mitgeliefertes libtashkeel-ONNX-Modell von etwa 4.8 MB ergänzt fehlende Vokalzeichen auf der CPU. Vorhandene Zeichen bleiben maßgeblich; die Analyse ruft kein LLM auf.","qafiyaDraftTitle":"Gedichtentwürfe sind experimentell","qafiyaDraftDetail":"Ein optionaler Anbieter entwirft Gedichte und überarbeitet fehlerhafte Verse, ohne akzeptierten Text zu ändern. In der öffentlichen Demo ist die Generierung deaktiviert.","qafiyaFrontend":"Frontend: React 19, TypeScript und Vite mit responsivem arabischem RTL-Layout.","qafiyaBackend":"Backend: Python 3.12, FastAPI, PyArud, NumPy und ONNX Runtime auf der CPU. Ein Worker nutzt eine gemeinsame, begrenzte Inference Session.","qafiyaDeploy":"Hosting: Frontend auf Cloudflare Pages und Docker-API auf Render. GitHub Actions prüft Frontend, Backend und Production Container.","qafiyaTryTitle":"Versmaß und Reim entdecken.","generationPaused":"Die Analyse ist in der Demo verfügbar. AI-Generierung ist deaktiviert.","cvFormat":"PDF · 129 KB","story0Title":"Wenn ein Audioausschnitt mehr Kontext braucht","story0Summary":"Sprechererkennung und Verssuche trennen und Unsicherheit im Ablauf sichtbar machen.","story0Section0Title":"Zwei Fragen, zwei Pipelines","story0Section0Text":"Eine Stimme zu erkennen und Wörter zu erkennen sind unterschiedliche Aufgaben. Quranic Shazam verwendet ECAPA-TDNN Speaker Embeddings mit ONNX Runtime, um Treffer anhand von 20 Rezitatorenprofilen zu ordnen. Die Verssuche nutzt dagegen ein an den Koran angepasstes Whisper-Modell, normalisiert das arabische Transkript und vergleicht es mit 6.236 Versen. Das Modell für Speaker Embeddings wird im Pretrained-Zustand verwendet; ein Fine-Tuning mit Koranaufnahmen fand nicht statt.","story0Section1Title":"Vor einer sicheren Antwort mehr Kontext sammeln","story0Section1Text":"Eine kurze Rezitation kann zu mehreren Versen passen. Die schrittweise Aufnahme ergänzt Audiokontext bis zu einer Grenze von 60 Sekunden. Mehrdeutige Ergebnisse bleiben als unsicher gekennzeichnet. Dafür wird eine längere Aufnahmezeit in Kauf genommen, statt frühzeitig eine Antwort zu erzwingen.","story0Section2Title":"Inference außerhalb des Event Loop ausführen","story0Section2Text":"Die Inference des Modells läuft außerhalb des asynchronen Event Loop der API. Dateien sind auf 25 MB begrenzt; je nach Erkennungsmodus gelten zusätzliche Grenzen für die Audiodauer. So bleiben aufwendige Anfragen begrenzt, während die API sowohl Dateien als auch Live-Mikrofonsitzungen unterstützt.","story0Section3Title":"Eine klar definierte Aufgabe messen","story0Section3Text":"Die Offline-Auswertung vom 5. September 2026 ergab 97,31 % Top-1 und 99,10 % Top-3 bei der Rezitatorenerkennung auf 781 zurückgehaltenen Clips. Für Profile und Auswertung wurden unterschiedliche Suren verwendet. Diese Werte beschreiben nur diesen Rezitatoren-Benchmark. Sie messen keine Verserkennung und garantieren keine Ergebnisse bei beliebigen Mikrofonen, Störgeräuschen oder Aufnahmen.","story1Title":"Arabische Verslehre auf einem kleinen CPU-Server","story1Summary":"Ein 4.8-MB-Modell zur Vokalisierung, unveränderte vorhandene Vokalzeichen und klare Grenzen der automatischen Analyse.","story1Section0Title":"Das Modell an die verfügbaren Ressourcen anpassen","story1Section0Text":"Qafiya verbindet die klassische Versanalyse von PyArud mit einem mitgelieferten libtashkeel-ONNX-Modell von etwa 4.8 MB. Die Vokalisierung läuft lokal auf der CPU, ohne PyTorch, Transformers, GPU oder externen Modellserver. Ein einzelner Uvicorn Worker nutzt eine gemeinsame, begrenzte und serialisierte Inference Session. So bleiben Modellkopien und parallele Ausführungen kontrollierbar.","story1Section1Title":"Den Text des Autors bewahren","story1Section1Text":"Vorhandene Vokalzeichen haben Vorrang. Die automatische Vokalisierung ergänzt fehlende Zeichen und legt Änderungen offen. Die Oberfläche zeigt den analysierten Text und bewahrt zugleich die ursprüngliche Eingabe. Das ist wichtig, weil die Skansion von der Aussprache abhängt und ein vorhergesagter Vokal das Ergebnis verändern kann.","story1Section2Title":"Den Container testen und Grenzen benennen","story1Section2Text":"Der dokumentierte lokale Test führte das Production Image mit einer Last über die gesamte ASGI-Anwendung unter 512 MiB RAM und 0.1 CPU aus. Der Process RSS erreichte maximal 142.55 MiB, ohne Out-of-Memory-Fehler. Das belegt das Verhalten bei einer begrenzten Last und garantiert keine Stabilität bei beliebigem öffentlichem Traffic. In einer separaten Stichprobe mit 12 Versen stiegen die Metrumtreffer bei teilweise vokalisierten Texten von 2/12 auf 10/12; Texte ganz ohne Vokalzeichen erreichten nur 2/12.","story1Section3Title":"Korrekturen begrenzen und gültigen Text erhalten","story1Section3Text":"Der experimentelle Workflow prüft Metrum und gewünschten Rawi und überarbeitet fehlerhafte Verse in einer begrenzten Schleife. Das Backend erhält akzeptierte Verse und gültige Halbverse. Die Gleichheit des Rawi ist keine vollständige Prüfung des klassischen Reims, und maschinelle Akzeptanz bestätigt keine literarische Qualität. Die AI-Generierung bleibt in der öffentlichen Demo deaktiviert.","notebookTitle":"Engineering-Notizbuch","readNote":"Technische Notiz lesen","allNotes":"Zurück zu allen Notizen","noteLabel":"Technische Notiz","readingTime":"3 Min. Lesezeit","articleContext":"Ein Einblick in die technischen Entscheidungen und dokumentierten Ergebnisse im Repository des Projekts.","contentsLabel":"In diesem Artikel","sourcesTitle":"Quellen und Implementierung","sourceReadme":"Projekt-README","sourceEvidence":"Auswertung und Nachweise","exploreProject":"Projekt ansehen","continueReading":"Weiterlesen","writtenBy":"Von","writingTitle":"Technische Entscheidungen verständlich erklärt.","evidenceCaption":"Basierend auf dem Projekt-README und den verlinkten Auswertungen.","copyLink":"Link kopieren","linkCopied":"Link kopiert","writingKicker":"Engineering-Notizbuch","downloadCV":"Lebenslauf herunterladen","contactIntent":"In Tunesien · Offen für internationale Remote-Stellen im Bereich Backend & AI.","employmentDates":"Softwareentwickler · Juli 2026 — Heute","internshipDates":"Zuvor: Abschlusspraktikum bei SpeakDuo · Jan. — Juli 2026.","achievementFeedback":"Mehrsprachiges Grammatik- und Aussprachefeedback entwickeln, damit Lernende Gespräche nachbereiten, Fehler verstehen und ihre nächsten Übungsschritte erkennen können.","achievementVoice":"Live-Untertitel, Übersetzung und AI-Sprachinterviews integrieren, um Gespräche in verschiedenen Sprachen zu üben und gesprochene Interaktionen leichter zu verfolgen.","decisionsKicker":"HERAUSFORDERUNGEN UND ABWÄGUNGEN","decisionsTitle":"Die Gründe für diese technischen Entscheidungen.","switchDark":"Dunkles Design aktivieren","switchLight":"Helles Design aktivieren","opensNewTab":"Öffnet in einem neuen Tab","technologyLabel":"Technologien","contactLinksLabel":"Kontakt und soziale Profile","homeLabel":"Startseite von Taha Chelly","browseNotebook":"Notizbuch ansehen","navNotebook":"Notizbuch","sectionLink":"Link zu diesem Abschnitt","projectSectionsLabel":"Projektabschnitte","projectScreenshots":"Screenshots","projectArchitecture":"Funktionsweise","projectDecisions":"Entscheidungen","reciterScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam: Ansicht zur Rezitatorenerkennung","verseScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam: Ansicht zur Verssuche","qafiyaDesktopAlt":"Qafiya: Analyse arabischer Gedichte auf dem Desktop","qafiyaMobileAlt":"Qafiya: Analyse arabischer Gedichte auf dem Smartphone","remoteOpportunity":"In Tunesien · Offen für internationale Remote-Stellen im Bereich Backend & AI.","exploreProjects":"Projekte ansehen","reciterEvidenceContext":"Rezitatorerkennung · Offline-Auswertung mit 781 zurückgehaltenen Clips; Verserkennung nicht gemessen.","qafiyaEvidenceContext":"Lokale Container-Last · maximaler Prozess-RSS von 142.55 MiB bei 512 MiB RAM-Limit; kein Test mit öffentlichem Datenverkehr.","reciterEvidence":"97.31% top-1 · 99.10% top-3","qafiyaEvidence":"4.8 MB · CPU ONNX","achievementPractice":"Wortschatzverfolgung, Wiederholungsübungen und persönliche Grammatikübungen entwickeln, um Wörter und Sprachmuster aus Gesprächen erneut zu üben.","achievementMultiplayer":"AI-Chat und synchronisierte Gruppenlernaktivitäten umsetzen und dabei backend-Dienste mit interaktiven Erlebnissen in der Web-App verbinden.","speakduoCaseLabel":"FALLSTUDIE","speakduoCaseTitle":"Gespräche zu Lerngelegenheiten machen.","speakduoCaseSummary":"AI-Chat, mehrsprachige Lerninhalte, Wortschatzwerkzeuge und interaktive Übungen: ausgewählte Beiträge bei SpeakDuo.","speakduoCaseLink":"SpeakDuo-Fallstudie lesen","speakduoCaseBack":"← Zurück zur Berufserfahrung","speakduoCaseContextTitle":"Was Lernende brauchen","speakduoCaseContext":"Bei SpeakDuo arbeite ich an Sprachlernfunktionen im backend und in der Web-App. Diese Beispiele beschreiben zusammengeführte Beiträge zu AI-Chat, Lerninhalten, persönlichen Übungen und Gruppenaktivitäten.","speakduoCasePracticeTitle":"Persönliche Übungen","speakduoCasePractice":"Ich implementierte Satzübungen mit geplanten Wiederholungen und arbeitete am persönlichen Grammatikarchiv. Lernende können Korrekturbeispiele ansehen, Übungen speichern, Sitzungen fortsetzen und ihren Fortschritt prüfen.","speakduoCaseRoleTitle":"Mein Beitrag","speakduoCaseRole":"Meine Beiträge umfassen Python-backend-Dienste, React-Oberflächen, Integration, Tests und Fehlerbehebungen. Ich arbeitete nach den Produkt- und Entwicklungskonventionen des Teams, ging auf Reviews ein und prüfte das Funktionsverhalten.","speakduoCaseChatTitle":"AI-Chatbot","speakduoCaseChat":"Ich entwickelte Ashs AI-Chat im backend und in der Web-App, mit Gesprächsverlauf, schrittweise angezeigten Antworten und Diskussionsverwaltung. Außerdem arbeitete ich daran, dass der Assistent tatsächlich vorhandene Lernfunktionen empfiehlt.","speakduoCaseVoiceTitle":"AI-Interview-Sprachagent und Feedback","speakduoCaseVoice":"Ich arbeitete an der mehrsprachigen Unterstützung des AI-Interview-Sprachagenten sowie an Grammatik- und Aussprachefeedback. Außerdem verbesserte ich die Verarbeitung von Live-Untertiteln und die Unterscheidung alltäglicher gesprochener Ausdrücke von echten Fehlern.","speakduoCoverAlt":"SpeakDuo-Titelbild: Gespräch, Stimme und Übungen mit Sprechblasen, Audiowelle und Buch.","speakduoCaseLessonsTitle":"Lerninhalte mit generativer AI","speakduoCaseLessons":"Ich erweiterte die AI-Lektionserstellung um mehrere Sprachen und arbeitete an generierten Geschichten, Dialogen und Grammatikübungen. Dazu gehörten eigenständig verständliche Beispiele und das Üben von Wörtern und Ausdrücken im Kontext.","speakduoCaseVocabularyTitle":"Wortschatz und Lesen","speakduoCaseVocabulary":"Ich entwickelte Wortschatzverfolgung und Wiederholungsfunktionen, darunter gespeicherte Wörter, Übersetzungsverlauf und Wortbedeutungen. Außerdem arbeitete ich an Leseangeboten mit generierten Geschichten und importierten Artikeln, Lückentexten und Grammatikquiz.","speakduoCaseActivitiesTitle":"Interaktive Gruppenaktivitäten","speakduoCaseActivities":"Ich implementierte Aktivitäten wie Trivia, Missing Word, Word Connect und Präferenzumfragen. Meine Beiträge umfassten Aktivitätsfunktionen, Moderationssteuerung und Interaktionen für gemeinsames Üben in Sitzungen.","communityKicker":"EHRENAMTLICHES ENGAGEMENT","communityTitle":"Weitergeben, was ich gelernt habe.","communityClub":"First Skills Club Association","communityLocation":"Sfax, Tunesien","communityContext":"Ein tunesischer gemeinnütziger Verein, in dem Jugendliche durch STEAM-Aktivitäten unter Gleichaltrigen Technologie, englische Kommunikation und Führungskompetenzen erlernen.","communitySupervisor":"Betreuer für 3D-Design","communitySupervisorDates":"Aug. 2022 — Aug. 2025","communityCoach":"Trainer für 3D-Design","communityCoachDates":"Sept. 2019 — Juni 2023","communityLink":"First Skills Club auf LinkedIn"},"fr":{"languageLabel":"Langue","navAbout":"À propos","navWork":"Travail","navContact":"Contact","intro":"BONJOUR, JE SUIS TAHA","heroTitle":"Ingénieur<br><span>Backend & AI.</span>","heroDescription":"Je construis des systèmes Python en production, des expériences AI en temps réel et des applications intelligentes, des API au déploiement.","connect":"Parlons-en","github":"GitHub","currentlyAt":"Actuellement chez <a href=\"#work\">SpeakDuo</a>","role":"Ingénieur logiciel","portraitNote":"Je transforme les idées en expériences concrètes","aboutKicker":"QUELQUES MOTS","aboutTitle":"La personne derrière le code.","aboutText":"Je suis Taha Chelly, ingénieur logiciel à Sfax, en Tunisie. J’aime accompagner un produit de l’idée à sa réalisation : une interface claire, un backend fiable et l’intelligence qui le rend vraiment utile.","aboutDetail":"Diplômé en génie logiciel, j’ai de l’expérience dans le développement de backends Python, d’API REST et d’applications AI avec FastAPI, SQL et Docker. J’ai contribué à des fonctionnalités en production chez SpeakDuo et réalisé des projets AI de bout en bout. Je recherche un poste de développeur Python à temps plein pour construire des services backend fiables et approfondir mon expertise en AI engineering.","tagFullStack":"Développement full-stack","tagAI":"Applications AI","tagRealtime":"Expériences en temps réel","workKicker":"MON TRAVAIL ACTUEL","workTitle":"Créer avec du sens.","current":"Poste actuel","workHeading":"J’aide chacun à apprendre des langues.<br>Une conversation à la fois.","workDescription":"Je développe des fonctionnalités backend et AI pour la plateforme de langues SpeakDuo en production, entre services Python, application web et expériences vocales en temps réel.","remote":"À distance","toolkitTitle":"Quelques outils que j’utilise","contactKicker":"LES BELLES IDÉES COMMENCENT PAR UNE CONVERSATION","contactTitle":"Créons quelque chose<br><span>qui mérite qu’on en parle.</span>","footerLine":"Créé avec soin. Toujours en évolution.","backToTop":"Retour en haut ↑","navProjects":"Projets","projectsKicker":"PROJETS SÉLECTIONNÉS","projectsTitle":"Des idées qui prennent vie.","viewProject":"Découvrir le projet ↗","projectCategory":"RECONNAISSANCE AUDIO · ML APPLIQUÉ · FastAPI","projectSummary":"Identifiez le récitateur et retrouvez le verset que vous écoutez. Une application de reconnaissance de récitations du Coran, en direct ou à partir d’un fichier audio.","backProjects":"← Tous les projets","liveDemo":"Essayer la démo","sourceCode":"Voir sur GitHub","screenshotsKicker":"EN IMAGES","screenshotsTitle":"Deux façons d’explorer une récitation.","reciterCaption":"Reconnaissance du récitateur : importez un fichier ou écoutez en direct.","verseCaption":"Recherche de versets : retrouvez la sourate et le verset récités.","approachKicker":"COMMENT ÇA MARCHE","approachTitle":"Du son à la reconnaissance.","reciterTitle":"Identifier le récitateur","reciterDetail":"Le modèle ECAPA-TDNN génère un voice embedding. ONNX Runtime exécute le traitement d’inference, puis la cosine similarity permet de classer les correspondances avec les profils de 20 récitateurs.","verseTitle":"Retrouver le verset","verseDetail":"Un modèle Whisper adapté au Coran transcrit l’audio arabe. Le texte normalisé est comparé à 6 236 versets pour retrouver la sourate et les versets probables.","contextTitle":"Écouter davantage","contextDetail":"Si plusieurs versets restent possibles, l’écoute progressive recueille plus de contexte. Les résultats incertains sont signalés comme tels.","stackKicker":"TECHNOLOGIES","stackTitle":"Les outils derrière le projet.","frontendDetail":"Frontend : React 19 et TypeScript, avec Vite et Tailwind CSS 4. La capture audio du navigateur et l’envoi de fichiers se connectent à l’API.","backendDetail":"Backend : Python et FastAPI, avec WebSockets pour identifier les récitateurs en direct. ONNX Runtime calcule les speaker embeddings ; faster-whisper et CTranslate2 transcrivent les récitations.","deployDetail":"Déploiement : Docker containers sur Render, avec Nginx pour servir le frontend. GitHub Actions vérifie le backend et le frontend avant de déployer les services modifiés.","tryTitle":"Écoutez. Découvrez.","qafiyaCategory":"NLP ARABE · ALGORITHMES · CPU AI","qafiyaSummary":"Un atelier de poésie arabe pour explorer le mètre classique, la rime, la scansion et la vocalisation locale.","qafiyaCaptionDesk":"Espace d’écriture — choisissez un mètre classique et une lettre de rime, puis examinez le vers.","qafiyaCaptionMobile":"Analyse de poésie arabe adaptée au mobile.","qafiyaApproachTitle":"Du vers écrit à son rythme.","qafiyaAnalysisTitle":"Analyser le mètre classique","qafiyaAnalysisDetail":"Comparez les vers arabes à 16 mètres classiques avec PyArud. Explorez les deux hémistiches, la scansion binaire, les pieds et la lettre de rime demandée (rawi).","qafiyaTashkeelTitle":"Compléter les signes vocaliques localement","qafiyaTashkeelDetail":"Un modèle libtashkeel ONNX embarqué d’environ 4.8 MB complète les signes vocaliques manquants sur CPU. Les signes déjà fournis restent prioritaires ; l’analyse n’appelle pas de LLM.","qafiyaDraftTitle":"La génération reste expérimentale","qafiyaDraftDetail":"Un adaptateur optionnel rédige des poèmes et corrige les vers en échec tout en préservant le texte accepté. La génération est désactivée sur la démo publique.","qafiyaFrontend":"Frontend : React 19, TypeScript et Vite, avec une interface arabe RTL adaptative.","qafiyaBackend":"Backend : Python 3.12, FastAPI, PyArud, NumPy et ONNX Runtime sur CPU. Un seul worker partage une session d’inference dont l’utilisation est limitée.","qafiyaDeploy":"Hébergement : frontend sur Cloudflare Pages et API Docker sur Render. GitHub Actions vérifie le frontend, le backend et le container de production.","qafiyaTryTitle":"Explorez le mètre et la rime.","generationPaused":"L’analyse est disponible sur la démo. La génération AI est désactivée.","downloadCV":"Télécharger le CV","contactIntent":"Basé en Tunisie · Ouvert aux postes internationaux à distance en Backend & AI.","employmentDates":"Ingénieur logiciel · Juil. 2026 — Aujourd’hui","internshipDates":"Auparavant : stage de fin d’études chez SpeakDuo · Janv. — Juil. 2026.","achievementFeedback":"Développer des retours multilingues sur la grammaire et la prononciation pour aider les apprenants à revoir leurs conversations, comprendre leurs erreurs et cibler leur pratique.","achievementVoice":"Intégrer des sous-titres en direct, la traduction et des entretiens vocaux AI pour pratiquer la conversation dans plusieurs langues et mieux suivre les échanges.","writingKicker":"Carnet d’ingénierie","writingTitle":"Les choix techniques, expliqués.","decisionsKicker":"DÉFIS ET COMPROMIS","decisionsTitle":"Les raisons de ces choix techniques.","readNote":"Lire la note technique","cvFormat":"PDF · 129 KB","story0Title":"Quand un extrait audio ne suffit pas","story0Summary":"Distinguer l’identification d’une voix de celle d’un verset, et intégrer l’incertitude au parcours d’écoute.","story0Section0Title":"Deux questions, deux pipelines","story0Section0Text":"Reconnaître une voix et reconnaître des mots sont deux problèmes différents. Quranic Shazam utilise des speaker embeddings ECAPA-TDNN avec ONNX Runtime pour classer les correspondances avec 20 profils de récitateurs. Pour retrouver un verset, un modèle Whisper adapté au Coran transcrit l’audio, puis le texte arabe est normalisé et comparé à 6 236 versets. Le modèle de speaker embeddings est utilisé tel quel (pretrained), sans fine-tuning sur des récitations du Coran.","story0Section1Title":"Demander du contexte avant de conclure","story0Section1Text":"Un court extrait peut correspondre à plusieurs versets. L’écoute progressive ajoute du contexte audio, jusqu’à 60 secondes, et les résultats ambigus restent signalés comme incertains. Ce choix privilégie une écoute plus longue pour recueillir davantage de contexte, plutôt qu’une réponse prématurée.","story0Section2Title":"Garder l’inference hors de l’event loop","story0Section2Text":"L’inference du modèle s’exécute en dehors de l’event loop asynchrone de l’API. Les fichiers sont limités à 25 MB, avec des durées audio maximales propres à chaque mode. Ces limites bornent le coût des requêtes tout en permettant l’envoi de fichiers et l’écoute au microphone en direct.","story0Section3Title":"Mesurer une tâche bien définie","story0Section3Text":"L’évaluation offline du 5 septembre 2026 rapporte 97,31 % en top-1 et 99,10 % en top-3 sur 781 extraits réservés à l’évaluation, avec des sourates distinctes pour les profils et les tests. Ces chiffres concernent uniquement ce benchmark d’identification des récitateurs. Ils ne mesurent pas la reconnaissance des versets et ne garantissent pas les résultats avec n’importe quel microphone, bruit ambiant ou enregistrement.","story1Title":"La prosodie arabe sur un petit serveur CPU","story1Summary":"Un modèle de vocalisation de 4.8 MB, des signes vocaliques préservés et des limites explicites pour l’analyse automatique.","story1Section0Title":"Adapter le modèle aux ressources disponibles","story1Section0Text":"Qafiya associe l’analyse de la prosodie classique de PyArud à un modèle libtashkeel ONNX embarqué d’environ 4.8 MB. La vocalisation s’exécute localement sur CPU, sans PyTorch, Transformers, GPU ni serveur de modèles externe. Un seul Uvicorn worker partage une session d’inference dont les requêtes sont limitées et exécutées en série, afin de maîtriser le nombre de copies du modèle et les exécutions simultanées.","story1Section1Title":"Respecter le texte de l’auteur","story1Section1Text":"Les signes vocaliques déjà présents restent prioritaires. La vocalisation automatique complète les signes manquants et indique les modifications ; l’interface affiche le texte analysé tout en conservant l’original. Cette distinction compte, car la scansion dépend de la prononciation : une voyelle prédite peut changer le résultat.","story1Section2Title":"Tester le container et préciser les limites","story1Section2Text":"Le test local documenté a exécuté l’image de production sur l’ensemble de l’application ASGI, avec des plafonds de 512 MiB de RAM et 0.1 CPU. Le process RSS a atteint 142.55 MiB sans erreur out-of-memory. Cette mesure porte sur une charge limitée et ne garantit pas le comportement sous un trafic public quelconque. Sur un autre échantillon de 12 vers, les correspondances de mètre sont passées de 2/12 à 10/12 à partir de textes partiellement vocalisés ; les textes entièrement dépourvus de signes vocaliques n’ont atteint que 2/12.","story1Section3Title":"Limiter les corrections et préserver le texte valide","story1Section3Text":"Le workflow expérimental vérifie le mètre et le rawi demandé, puis corrige les vers qui ne respectent pas ces contraintes dans une boucle limitée. Le backend conserve les vers acceptés et les hémistiches valides. L’égalité du rawi ne suffit pas à valider toute la rime classique, et l’acceptation automatique ne certifie pas la qualité littéraire. La génération par AI reste désactivée sur la démo publique.","notebookTitle":"Carnet d’ingénierie","allNotes":"Retour aux notes","noteLabel":"Note technique","readingTime":"3 min de lecture","articleContext":"Une présentation des choix techniques et des résultats documentés dans le dépôt du projet.","contentsLabel":"Dans cet article","sourcesTitle":"Sources et implémentation","sourceReadme":"README du projet","sourceEvidence":"Évaluation et résultats","exploreProject":"Explorer le projet","continueReading":"Poursuivre la lecture","writtenBy":"Par","evidenceCaption":"D’après le README du projet et les évaluations associées.","copyLink":"Copier le lien","linkCopied":"Lien copié","switchDark":"Passer au thème sombre","switchLight":"Passer au thème clair","opensNewTab":"S’ouvre dans un nouvel onglet","technologyLabel":"Technologies","contactLinksLabel":"Contact et réseaux sociaux","homeLabel":"Accueil de Taha Chelly","browseNotebook":"Parcourir le carnet","navNotebook":"Carnet","sectionLink":"Lien vers cette section","projectSectionsLabel":"Rubriques du projet","projectScreenshots":"Captures","projectArchitecture":"Fonctionnement","projectDecisions":"Choix techniques","reciterScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam : écran de reconnaissance du récitateur","verseScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam : écran de recherche de versets","qafiyaDesktopAlt":"Qafiya : analyse de poésie arabe sur ordinateur","qafiyaMobileAlt":"Qafiya : analyse de poésie arabe sur mobile","remoteOpportunity":"Basé en Tunisie · Ouvert aux postes internationaux à distance en Backend & AI.","exploreProjects":"Explorer les projets","reciterEvidenceContext":"Reconnaissance du récitant · évaluation hors ligne sur 781 extraits réservés ; identification des versets non mesurée.","qafiyaEvidenceContext":"Charge locale en conteneur · pic RSS du processus de 142.55 MiB sous une limite de 512 MiB RAM ; pas un test de trafic public.","reciterEvidence":"97.31% top-1 · 99.10% top-3","qafiyaEvidence":"4.8 MB · CPU ONNX","achievementPractice":"Construire le suivi du vocabulaire, des exercices de révision et une pratique grammaticale personnalisée pour retrouver les mots et les structures rencontrés en conversation.","achievementMultiplayer":"Livrer un chat AI et des activités de groupe synchronisées, en reliant les services backend aux expériences interactives de l’application web.","speakduoCaseLabel":"ÉTUDE DE CAS","speakduoCaseTitle":"Transformer les conversations en occasions d’apprendre.","speakduoCaseSummary":"Chat AI, contenus multilingues, outils de vocabulaire et pratique interactive : contributions sélectionnées chez SpeakDuo.","speakduoCaseLink":"Lire l’étude de cas SpeakDuo","speakduoCaseBack":"← Retour à l’expérience","speakduoCaseContextTitle":"Le besoin des apprenants","speakduoCaseContext":"Chez SpeakDuo, je développe des fonctionnalités d’apprentissage dans le backend et l’application web. Ces exemples portent sur des contributions intégrées : chat AI, contenus, pratique personnelle et activités de groupe.","speakduoCasePracticeTitle":"Pratique personnelle","speakduoCasePractice":"J’ai implémenté la révision de phrases avec répétitions planifiées et contribué aux archives personnelles de grammaire. Les apprenants peuvent revoir des corrections, enregistrer des exercices, reprendre leurs séances et consulter leur progression.","speakduoCaseRoleTitle":"Ma contribution","speakduoCaseRole":"Mes contributions couvrent les services backend Python, les interfaces React, l’intégration, les tests et les corrections. J’ai suivi les conventions produit et techniques de l’équipe, répondu aux revues et vérifié le comportement des fonctionnalités.","speakduoCaseChatTitle":"Chatbot AI","speakduoCaseChat":"J’ai développé le chat AI d’Ash dans le backend et l’application web, avec historique, réponses progressives et gestion des discussions. J’ai aussi travaillé sur ses recommandations pour qu’elles correspondent aux fonctionnalités réellement disponibles.","speakduoCaseVoiceTitle":"Agent vocal d’entretien AI et retours","speakduoCaseVoice":"J’ai travaillé sur le support multilingue de l’agent vocal d’entretien AI et sur les retours de grammaire et de prononciation. J’ai aussi amélioré le traitement des sous-titres et adapté les retours pour distinguer les expressions orales courantes des erreurs réelles.","speakduoCoverAlt":"Couverture SpeakDuo : conversation, voix et pratique illustrées par des bulles, une onde audio et un livre.","speakduoCaseLessonsTitle":"Contenus pédagogiques avec AI générative","speakduoCaseLessons":"J’ai étendu la génération de leçons AI au multilingue et travaillé sur les histoires, dialogues et exercices de grammaire générés. J’ai notamment amélioré les exemples pour qu’ils soient compréhensibles seuls et permettent de pratiquer les expressions en contexte.","speakduoCaseVocabularyTitle":"Vocabulaire et lecture","speakduoCaseVocabulary":"J’ai construit des fonctionnalités de suivi et de révision du vocabulaire : mots enregistrés, historique des traductions et recherche de sens. J’ai aussi travaillé sur la lecture d’histoires générées et d’articles importés, avec textes à compléter et quiz de grammaire.","speakduoCaseActivitiesTitle":"Activités de groupe interactives","speakduoCaseActivities":"J’ai implémenté des activités dont les quiz trivia, Missing Word, Word Connect et les sondages de préférences. Mes contributions couvrent les fonctionnalités, les commandes des animateurs et les interactions des apprenants pendant les séances.","communityKicker":"ENGAGEMENT ASSOCIATIF","communityTitle":"Transmettre ce que j’ai appris.","communityClub":"Association First Skills Club","communityLocation":"Sfax, Tunisie","communityContext":"Une association tunisienne où les jeunes développent leurs compétences en technologie, en communication en anglais et en leadership grâce à des activités STEAM animées par leurs pairs.","communitySupervisor":"Superviseur en conception 3D","communitySupervisorDates":"Août 2022 — août 2025","communityCoach":"Formateur en conception 3D","communityCoachDates":"Sept. 2019 — juin 2023","communityLink":"First Skills Club sur LinkedIn"},"it":{"languageLabel":"Lingua","navAbout":"Chi sono","navWork":"Lavoro","navContact":"Contatti","intro":"CIAO, SONO TAHA","heroTitle":"Ingegnere<br><span>Backend & AI.</span>","heroDescription":"Realizzo sistemi Python in produzione, esperienze AI in tempo reale e applicazioni intelligenti, dalle API al rilascio.","connect":"Parliamone","github":"GitHub","currentlyAt":"Attualmente in <a href=\"#work\">SpeakDuo</a>","role":"Ingegnere del software","portraitNote":"Trasformo le idee in esperienze concrete","aboutKicker":"QUALCHE INFORMAZIONE","aboutTitle":"La persona dietro il codice.","aboutText":"Sono Taha Chelly, ingegnere del software a Sfax, in Tunisia. Mi piace seguire un prodotto dall’idea alla realizzazione: un’interfaccia chiara, un backend affidabile e l’intelligenza che lo rende davvero utile.","aboutDetail":"Sono laureato in ingegneria del software con esperienza nello sviluppo di backend Python, API REST e applicazioni di AI con FastAPI, SQL e Docker. Ho contribuito a funzionalità in produzione di SpeakDuo e realizzato progetti di AI completi. Cerco un ruolo a tempo pieno come sviluppatore Python per creare servizi backend affidabili e crescere nell’ingegneria dell’AI.","tagFullStack":"Sviluppo full-stack","tagAI":"Applicazioni AI","tagRealtime":"Esperienze in tempo reale","workKicker":"A COSA STO LAVORANDO","workTitle":"Costruire con uno scopo.","current":"Ruolo attuale","workHeading":"Aiuto le persone a imparare le lingue.<br>Una conversazione alla volta.","workDescription":"Sviluppo funzionalità backend e AI per la piattaforma di lingue SpeakDuo in produzione, lavorando su servizi Python, app web ed esperienze vocali in tempo reale.","remote":"Da remoto","toolkitTitle":"Alcuni strumenti che uso","contactKicker":"LE BELLE IDEE INIZIANO CON UNA CONVERSAZIONE","contactTitle":"Creiamo qualcosa<br><span>di cui valga la pena parlare.</span>","footerLine":"Creato con cura. In continua evoluzione.","backToTop":"Torna all’inizio ↑","navProjects":"Progetti","projectsKicker":"PROGETTI SELEZIONATI","projectsTitle":"Idee che prendono vita.","viewProject":"Esplora il progetto ↗","projectCategory":"RICONOSCIMENTO AUDIO · ML APPLICATO · FastAPI","projectSummary":"Scopri chi recita e quale versetto stai ascoltando. Un’app per riconoscere le recitazioni del Corano, dal vivo o caricando un file audio.","backProjects":"← Tutti i progetti","liveDemo":"Prova la demo","sourceCode":"Vedi su GitHub","screenshotsKicker":"UNO SGUARDO ALL’APP","screenshotsTitle":"Due modi per esplorare una recitazione.","reciterCaption":"Riconoscimento del recitatore: carica un audio o ascolta dal vivo.","verseCaption":"Ricerca dei versetti: trova la sura e il versetto recitati.","approachKicker":"COME FUNZIONA","approachTitle":"Dal suono al riconoscimento.","reciterTitle":"Riconoscere il recitatore","reciterDetail":"Il modello ECAPA-TDNN genera un voice embedding. ONNX Runtime esegue la fase di inference; la cosine similarity ordina poi le corrispondenze con i profili di 20 recitatori.","verseTitle":"Trovare il versetto","verseDetail":"Un modello Whisper adattato al Corano trascrive l’audio arabo. Il testo normalizzato viene confrontato con 6236 versetti.","contextTitle":"Ascoltare più contesto","contextDetail":"Se il versetto è ambiguo, l’ascolto progressivo raccoglie più audio. I risultati incerti rimangono segnalati come tali.","stackKicker":"TECNOLOGIE","stackTitle":"La tecnologia del progetto.","frontendDetail":"Frontend: React 19, TypeScript, Vite e Tailwind CSS 4. Microfono del browser e file audio si collegano all’API.","backendDetail":"Backend: Python e FastAPI, con WebSockets per identificare i recitatori in diretta. ONNX Runtime calcola gli speaker embeddings; faster-whisper e CTranslate2 trascrivono le recitazioni.","deployDetail":"Deploy: Docker containers su Render, con Nginx per servire il frontend. GitHub Actions verifica backend e frontend prima del deploy dei servizi modificati.","tryTitle":"Ascolta. Scopri.","qafiyaCategory":"NLP ARABO · ALGORITMI · CPU AI","qafiyaSummary":"Un laboratorio di poesia araba con metro classico, rima, scansione e vocalizzazione locale.","qafiyaCaptionDesk":"Spazio di scrittura — scegli un metro classico e una lettera di rima, poi esamina il verso.","qafiyaCaptionMobile":"Analisi di poesia araba in un layout adatto al telefono.","qafiyaApproachTitle":"Dal verso scritto al suo ritmo.","qafiyaAnalysisTitle":"Analizza il metro classico","qafiyaAnalysisDetail":"Verifica i versi arabi rispetto a 16 metri classici con PyArud. Esplora entrambi gli emistichi, la scansione binaria, i piedi e la lettera di rima richiesta (rawi).","qafiyaTashkeelTitle":"Completa la vocalizzazione in locale","qafiyaTashkeelDetail":"Un modello libtashkeel ONNX incluso di circa 4.8 MB completa i segni vocalici mancanti sulla CPU. Rispetta i segni già presenti e non usa un LLM per l’analisi.","qafiyaDraftTitle":"La generazione è sperimentale","qafiyaDraftDetail":"Un provider opzionale crea bozze e rivede i versi non validi preservando il testo accettato. La generazione è disattivata nella demo pubblica.","qafiyaFrontend":"Frontend: React 19, TypeScript e Vite con interfaccia araba responsive da destra a sinistra.","qafiyaBackend":"Backend: Python 3.12, FastAPI, PyArud, NumPy e ONNX Runtime su CPU. Un singolo worker condivide una sessione di inference il cui utilizzo è limitato.","qafiyaDeploy":"Hosting: frontend su Cloudflare Pages e API Docker su Render. GitHub Actions verifica frontend, backend e container di produzione.","qafiyaTryTitle":"Esplora metro e rima.","generationPaused":"L’analisi è disponibile nella demo. La generazione AI è disattivata.","cvFormat":"PDF · 129 KB","story0Title":"Quando un frammento audio richiede più contesto","story0Summary":"Separare il riconoscimento della voce dalla ricerca del versetto e rendere visibile l’incertezza durante l’ascolto.","story0Section0Title":"Due domande, due pipeline","story0Section0Text":"Riconoscere una voce e riconoscere le parole sono problemi diversi. Quranic Shazam usa speaker embeddings ECAPA-TDNN con ONNX Runtime per ordinare le corrispondenze con 20 profili di recitatori. La ricerca del versetto usa invece un modello Whisper adattato al Corano, normalizza la trascrizione araba e la confronta con 6.236 versetti. Il modello per speaker embeddings viene utilizzato nello stato pretrained, senza fine-tuning su registrazioni coraniche.","story0Section1Title":"Chiedere più contesto prima di dare una risposta certa","story0Section1Text":"Una recitazione breve può corrispondere a più versetti. L’ascolto progressivo aggiunge contesto audio fino a un limite di 60 secondi e i risultati ambigui restano indicati come incerti. Si accetta un ascolto più lungo in cambio di maggiore contesto, senza forzare una risposta prematura.","story0Section2Title":"Eseguire inference fuori dall’event loop","story0Section2Text":"La fase di inference del modello viene eseguita al di fuori dell’event loop asincrono dell’API. I file sono limitati a 25 MB, con limiti di durata diversi per ciascuna modalità. Questi vincoli mantengono finite le richieste costose, mentre l’API supporta sia i file sia le sessioni dal microfono in diretta.","story0Section3Title":"Misurare un compito ben definito","story0Section3Text":"La valutazione offline del 5 settembre 2026 riporta il 97,31% in top-1 e il 99,10% in top-3 per il riconoscimento del recitatore su 781 clip riservate alla valutazione, con sure distinte per i profili e i test. I risultati descrivono quel benchmark sui recitatori; non misurano il riconoscimento dei versetti e non garantiscono prestazioni con qualsiasi microfono, rumore o registrazione.","story1Title":"Prosodia araba su un piccolo server CPU","story1Summary":"Un modello di vocalizzazione da 4.8 MB, rispetto dei segni vocalici presenti e limiti espliciti dell’analisi automatica.","story1Section0Title":"Adattare il modello alle risorse disponibili","story1Section0Text":"Qafiya affianca l’analisi della prosodia classica di PyArud a un modello libtashkeel ONNX incluso di circa 4.8 MB. La vocalizzazione viene eseguita localmente sulla CPU senza PyTorch, Transformers, GPU o server esterni per i modelli. Un solo Uvicorn worker condivide una sessione di inference limitata e serializzata, per controllare le copie del modello e le esecuzioni simultanee.","story1Section1Title":"Preservare il testo dell’autore","story1Section1Text":"I segni vocalici già presenti hanno la precedenza. La vocalizzazione automatica completa quelli mancanti e segnala le modifiche; l’interfaccia mostra il testo analizzato e conserva l’originale. La distinzione conta perché la scansione dipende dalla pronuncia e una vocale prevista può cambiare il risultato.","story1Section2Title":"Provare il container e dichiarare i limiti","story1Section2Text":"Il test locale documentato ha eseguito l’immagine di produzione con un carico sull’intera applicazione ASGI, entro limiti di 512 MiB di RAM e 0.1 CPU. Il process RSS ha raggiunto un picco di 142.55 MiB senza errori out-of-memory. È una misura su un carico limitato, non una garanzia per qualsiasi traffico pubblico. In un altro campione di 12 versi, le corrispondenze metriche dei testi parzialmente vocalizzati sono passate da 2/12 a 10/12; i testi completamente privi di segni vocalici hanno raggiunto solo 2/12.","story1Section3Title":"Limitare le revisioni e conservare il testo valido","story1Section3Text":"Il workflow sperimentale verifica il metro e il rawi richiesto, poi rivede i versi non validi con un ciclo limitato. Il backend preserva i versi accettati e gli emistichi corretti. L’uguaglianza del rawi non equivale alla verifica completa della rima classica e l’accettazione automatica non certifica la qualità letteraria. La generazione con AI resta disattivata nella demo pubblica.","notebookTitle":"Quaderno di ingegneria","readNote":"Leggi la nota tecnica","allNotes":"Torna alle note","noteLabel":"Nota tecnica","readingTime":"3 min di lettura","articleContext":"Un approfondimento sulle scelte tecniche e sui risultati documentati nel repository del progetto.","contentsLabel":"In questo articolo","sourcesTitle":"Fonti e implementazione","sourceReadme":"README del progetto","sourceEvidence":"Valutazione e risultati","exploreProject":"Esplora il progetto","continueReading":"Continua a leggere","writtenBy":"Di","writingTitle":"Le scelte tecniche, spiegate.","evidenceCaption":"Basato sul README del progetto e sulle valutazioni collegate.","copyLink":"Copia link","linkCopied":"Link copiato","writingKicker":"Quaderno di ingegneria","downloadCV":"Scarica il CV","contactIntent":"In Tunisia · Disponibile per ruoli internazionali da remoto in Backend & AI.","employmentDates":"Ingegnere del software · Lug. 2026 — Oggi","internshipDates":"In precedenza: tirocinio di fine studi presso SpeakDuo · Gen. — Lug. 2026.","achievementFeedback":"Sviluppare feedback multilingue su grammatica e pronuncia per aiutare gli studenti a rivedere le conversazioni, capire gli errori e scegliere cosa esercitare.","achievementVoice":"Integrare sottotitoli dal vivo, traduzione e colloqui vocali AI per praticare conversazioni in più lingue e seguire meglio gli scambi parlati.","decisionsKicker":"SFIDE E COMPROMESSI","decisionsTitle":"Il perché delle scelte tecniche.","switchDark":"Attiva il tema scuro","switchLight":"Attiva il tema chiaro","opensNewTab":"Si apre in una nuova scheda","technologyLabel":"Tecnologie","contactLinksLabel":"Contatti e profili social","homeLabel":"Pagina iniziale di Taha Chelly","browseNotebook":"Sfoglia il quaderno","navNotebook":"Quaderno","sectionLink":"Link a questa sezione","projectSectionsLabel":"Sezioni del progetto","projectScreenshots":"Schermate","projectArchitecture":"Come funziona","projectDecisions":"Scelte tecniche","reciterScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam: schermata di riconoscimento del recitatore","verseScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam: schermata di ricerca dei versetti","qafiyaDesktopAlt":"Qafiya: analisi di poesia araba su computer","qafiyaMobileAlt":"Qafiya: analisi di poesia araba su smartphone","remoteOpportunity":"In Tunisia · Disponibile per ruoli internazionali da remoto in Backend & AI.","exploreProjects":"Esplora i progetti","reciterEvidenceContext":"Riconoscimento del recitatore · valutazione offline su 781 clip riservate; identificazione dei versetti non misurata.","qafiyaEvidenceContext":"Carico locale in container · picco RSS del processo di 142.55 MiB con limite di 512 MiB RAM; non misura il traffico pubblico.","reciterEvidence":"97.31% top-1 · 99.10% top-3","qafiyaEvidence":"4.8 MB · CPU ONNX","achievementPractice":"Creare tracciamento del vocabolario, esercizi di ripasso e pratica grammaticale personalizzata per ritrovare parole e strutture delle conversazioni.","achievementMultiplayer":"Realizzare chat AI e attività di apprendimento di gruppo sincronizzate, collegando servizi backend ed esperienze interattive nell’app web.","speakduoCaseLabel":"CASO DI STUDIO","speakduoCaseTitle":"Trasformare le conversazioni in occasioni di apprendimento.","speakduoCaseSummary":"Chat AI, contenuti multilingue, strumenti di vocabolario e pratica interattiva: contributi selezionati in SpeakDuo.","speakduoCaseLink":"Leggi il caso SpeakDuo","speakduoCaseBack":"← Torna all’esperienza","speakduoCaseContextTitle":"Il bisogno dello studente","speakduoCaseContext":"In SpeakDuo lavoro su funzionalità linguistiche nel backend e nell’app web. Questi esempi descrivono contributi integrati: chat AI, contenuti, pratica personale e attività di gruppo.","speakduoCasePracticeTitle":"Pratica personale","speakduoCasePractice":"Ho implementato il ripasso delle frasi con ripetizione programmata e contribuito all’archivio personale di grammatica. Gli studenti possono rivedere correzioni, salvare esercizi, riprendere sessioni e consultare i progressi.","speakduoCaseRoleTitle":"Il mio contributo","speakduoCaseRole":"I miei contributi comprendono servizi backend Python, interfacce React, integrazione, test e correzioni. Ho seguito le convenzioni del team, risposto alle revisioni e verificato il comportamento delle funzionalità.","speakduoCaseChatTitle":"Chatbot AI","speakduoCaseChat":"Ho sviluppato la chat AI di Ash nel backend e nell’app web, con cronologia, risposte progressive e gestione delle conversazioni. Ho anche lavorato per far consigliare all’assistente funzionalità realmente presenti nella piattaforma.","speakduoCaseVoiceTitle":"Agente vocale per colloqui AI e feedback","speakduoCaseVoice":"Ho lavorato sul supporto multilingue dell’agente vocale per colloqui AI e sul feedback grammaticale e di pronuncia. Ho anche migliorato l’elaborazione dei sottotitoli e il feedback per distinguere espressioni orali quotidiane da errori reali.","speakduoCoverAlt":"Copertina SpeakDuo: conversazione, voce e pratica con fumetti, un’onda audio e un libro.","speakduoCaseLessonsTitle":"Contenuti didattici con AI generativa","speakduoCaseLessons":"Ho esteso la generazione di lezioni AI al multilingue e lavorato su storie, dialoghi ed esercizi grammaticali generati. Ho migliorato gli esempi perché si capiscano da soli e aiutino a praticare parole ed espressioni nel contesto.","speakduoCaseVocabularyTitle":"Vocabolario e lettura","speakduoCaseVocabulary":"Ho costruito funzioni di tracciamento e ripasso del vocabolario: parole salvate, cronologia delle traduzioni e ricerca di significati. Ho anche lavorato sulla lettura di storie generate e articoli importati, con completamento di parole e quiz grammaticali.","speakduoCaseActivitiesTitle":"Attività di gruppo interattive","speakduoCaseActivities":"Ho implementato attività come trivia, Missing Word, Word Connect e sondaggi sulle preferenze. I contributi comprendevano funzionalità, controlli per gli organizzatori e interazioni per esercitarsi insieme durante le sessioni.","communityKicker":"IMPEGNO NELLA COMUNITÀ","communityTitle":"Condividere ciò che ho imparato.","communityClub":"Associazione First Skills Club","communityLocation":"Sfax, Tunisia","communityContext":"Un’associazione tunisina senza scopo di lucro dove i giovani imparano tecnologia, comunicazione in inglese e leadership attraverso attività STEAM guidate dai loro coetanei.","communitySupervisor":"Supervisore di progettazione 3D","communitySupervisorDates":"Ago 2022 — ago 2025","communityCoach":"Formatore di progettazione 3D","communityCoachDates":"Set 2019 — giu 2023","communityLink":"First Skills Club su LinkedIn"},"zh":{"languageLabel":"语言","navAbout":"关于","navWork":"工作","navContact":"联系","intro":"你好，我是 TAHA","heroTitle":"Backend 与 AI<br><span>工程师。</span>","heroDescription":"我构建用于生产环境的 Python 系统、实时 AI 体验和智能应用，涵盖从 API 到部署的完整流程。","connect":"联系我","github":"GitHub","currentlyAt":"目前就职于 <a href=\"#work\">SpeakDuo</a>","role":"软件工程师","portraitNote":"将想法转化为真实体验","aboutKicker":"关于我","aboutTitle":"代码背后的人。","aboutText":"我叫 Taha Chelly，是一名常驻突尼斯斯法克斯的软件工程师。我喜欢参与产品从构想到落地的全过程：打造清晰的界面、可靠的 backend，以及真正能解决问题的智能功能。","aboutDetail":"我毕业于软件工程专业，拥有使用 FastAPI、SQL 和 Docker 构建 Python backend、REST API 和 AI 应用的经验。我参与开发了 SpeakDuo 已投入生产的功能，并完成了端到端 AI 项目。我正在寻找全职 Python 开发岗位，希望构建可靠的 backend 服务，并在 AI engineering 领域持续成长。","tagFullStack":"全栈开发","tagAI":"AI 应用","tagRealtime":"实时体验","workKicker":"我正在做的事","workTitle":"有目标地创造。","current":"在职","workHeading":"帮助人们学好语言，<br>从一次次对话开始。","workDescription":"我为 SpeakDuo 的生产语言学习平台开发 backend 和 AI 功能，涵盖 Python 服务、网页应用和实时语音体验。","remote":"远程","toolkitTitle":"我使用的一些工具","contactKicker":"美好的想法始于一次交流","contactTitle":"一起做出<br><span>值得分享的作品。</span>","footerLine":"用心打造，不断进步。","backToTop":"返回顶部 ↑","navProjects":"项目","projectsKicker":"精选项目","projectsTitle":"让想法成为现实。","viewProject":"探索项目 ↗","projectCategory":"音频识别 · 应用机器学习 · FastAPI","projectSummary":"识别诵读者，查找正在聆听的经文。支持实时聆听和音频上传的《古兰经》诵读识别应用。","backProjects":"← 所有项目","liveDemo":"体验在线演示","sourceCode":"在 GitHub 上查看","screenshotsKicker":"应用截图","screenshotsTitle":"两种方式探索诵读。","reciterCaption":"诵读者识别：上传音频或实时聆听。","verseCaption":"经文查找：从诵读中找到章名和节号。","approachKicker":"工作原理","approachTitle":"从声音到识别结果。","reciterTitle":"识别诵读者","reciterDetail":"ECAPA-TDNN 模型生成 voice embedding，由 ONNX Runtime 执行 inference，再通过 cosine similarity 对 20 位诵读者的声纹档案进行匹配排序。","verseTitle":"查找经文","verseDetail":"针对《古兰经》优化的 Whisper 模型将阿拉伯语音频转为文字。规范化后的文本与 6,236 节经文进行比对。","contextTitle":"聆听更多上下文","contextDetail":"匹配不明确时，渐进式聆听会收集更多音频。不确定的结果会明确标注。","stackKicker":"技术栈","stackTitle":"项目背后的技术。","frontendDetail":"Frontend：使用 React 19 和 TypeScript，通过 Vite 和 Tailwind CSS 4 构建。浏览器录音和音频文件上传均通过 API 连接服务。","backendDetail":"Backend：使用 Python、FastAPI 和 WebSockets 实时识别诵读者。ONNX Runtime 计算 speaker embeddings；faster-whisper 和 CTranslate2 将诵读转写为文本。","deployDetail":"部署：在 Render 上运行 Docker containers，由 Nginx 提供 frontend 服务。GitHub Actions 检查 backend 和 frontend 后，再部署有变更的服务。","tryTitle":"聆听，发现。","qafiyaCategory":"阿拉伯语 NLP · 算法 · CPU AI","qafiyaSummary":"阿拉伯诗歌工作坊：探索古典格律、押韵、韵律切分和本地元音符号补全。","qafiyaCaptionDesk":"写作空间：选择古典格律和押韵字母，再查看诗句的韵律。","qafiyaCaptionMobile":"适配手机的阿拉伯诗歌分析界面。","qafiyaApproachTitle":"从诗句到韵律。","qafiyaAnalysisTitle":"分析古典格律","qafiyaAnalysisDetail":"使用 PyArud，按照 16 种古典格律检查阿拉伯诗句。查看两个半句、用二进制表示的节律、音步和指定的押韵字母（rawi）。","qafiyaTashkeelTitle":"在本地补全元音符号","qafiyaTashkeelDetail":"内置的约 4.8 MB libtashkeel ONNX 模型在 CPU 上补全缺失的元音符号，保留已有标注；分析不会调用 LLM。","qafiyaDraftTitle":"诗歌生成仍处于实验阶段","qafiyaDraftDetail":"可选模型可生成诗句，并针对未通过的诗句进行修改，同时保留已通过内容。公开演示暂未启用生成。","qafiyaFrontend":"Frontend：React 19、TypeScript 和 Vite，提供支持 RTL 的响应式阿拉伯语界面。","qafiyaBackend":"Backend：Python 3.12、FastAPI、PyArud、NumPy 和 CPU 版 ONNX Runtime。单个 worker 共享使用受限的 inference session。","qafiyaDeploy":"托管：frontend 位于 Cloudflare Pages，Docker API 位于 Render。GitHub Actions 检查 frontend、backend 和生产 container。","qafiyaTryTitle":"探索格律与押韵。","generationPaused":"演示版可进行诗歌分析。AI 生成目前已关闭。","cvFormat":"PDF · 129 KB","story0Title":"当一段音频还不足以确定结果","story0Summary":"将诵读者识别与经文检索分开处理，并在聆听过程中明确呈现不确定性。","story0Section0Title":"两个问题，两条 pipeline","story0Section0Text":"识别诵读者与识别词语是两种不同的任务。Quranic Shazam 通过 ONNX Runtime 运行 ECAPA-TDNN，生成 speaker embeddings，并对 20 位诵读者的声纹档案进行匹配排序。经文检索则使用针对《古兰经》优化的 Whisper 模型，将阿拉伯语转写文本规范化后，与 6,236 节经文比对。speaker embeddings 模型以 pretrained 状态使用，并未使用《古兰经》录音进行 fine-tuning。","story0Section1Title":"先补充上下文，再判断是否足够确定","story0Section1Text":"一段简短的诵读可能对应多节经文。渐进式聆听会持续补充音频上下文，最长 60 秒，同时将模糊结果标记为不确定。这一设计用更长的聆听时间换取更多上下文，而不是强行提前给出答案。","story0Section2Title":"让 inference 在 event loop 之外运行","story0Section2Text":"模型 inference 在 API 的异步 event loop 之外执行。上传文件最大为 25 MB，各识别模式另有音频时长限制。这些边界控制了高成本请求的范围，同时让 API 支持文件上传和实时麦克风会话。","story0Section3Title":"明确评估的是哪一项任务","story0Section3Text":"2026 年 9 月 5 日的 offline 评估使用 781 段留出的测试音频，诵读者识别的 top-1 为 97.31%，top-3 为 99.10%。声纹档案与评估音频采用不同章节。这些结果仅描述该诵读者 benchmark，不代表经文识别准确率，也不能保证在任意麦克风、噪声或录音条件下的表现。","story1Title":"在小型 CPU 服务器上分析阿拉伯诗律","story1Summary":"约 4.8 MB 的元音标注模型、对已有元音符号的保留，以及自动分析能力的明确边界。","story1Section0Title":"让模型适应托管资源","story1Section0Text":"Qafiya 将 PyArud 的古典诗律分析与内置的约 4.8 MB libtashkeel ONNX 模型结合。元音标注在本地 CPU 上运行，无需 PyTorch、Transformers、GPU 或外部模型服务器。单个 Uvicorn worker 共享受限且串行执行的 inference session，以控制模型副本数量和并发执行。","story1Section1Title":"保留作者原有的文字","story1Section1Text":"已有的元音符号具有优先权。自动元音标注只补全缺失符号，并说明改动；界面显示实际分析的文本，同时保留原始输入。这一区别很重要，因为诗律切分取决于发音，一个预测的元音就可能改变分析结果。","story1Section2Title":"测试 container，并说明测试边界","story1Section2Text":"文档记录的本地测试在 512 MiB RAM、0.1 CPU 的限制下，对生产镜像运行覆盖整个 ASGI 应用的工作负载。process RSS 峰值为 142.55 MiB，未出现 out-of-memory。这是有界工作负载下的证据，不能保证任意公网流量下的表现。另一组 12 个诗句的元音标注样本中，部分标注文本的格律匹配由 2/12 提高到 10/12；完全未标注元音符号的文本仅达到 2/12。","story1Section3Title":"限制修订范围，保留有效诗句","story1Section3Text":"实验性 workflow 先检查格律与指定的 rawi，再通过有界循环修订未通过的诗句。backend 保留已接受的诗句和正确的半句。rawi 相同并不等于通过完整的古典押韵验证，机器接受也不能证明文学质量。公开演示仍未启用 AI 生成。","notebookTitle":"工程笔记","readNote":"阅读技术笔记","allNotes":"返回全部笔记","noteLabel":"技术笔记","readingTime":"阅读约 3 分钟","articleContext":"介绍项目 repository 中记录的实现决策与评估结果。","contentsLabel":"本文目录","sourcesTitle":"来源与实现","sourceReadme":"项目 README","sourceEvidence":"评估与依据","exploreProject":"查看项目","continueReading":"继续阅读","writtenBy":"作者","writingTitle":"解读技术决策。","evidenceCaption":"依据项目 README 及其链接的评估报告。","copyLink":"复制链接","linkCopied":"链接已复制","writingKicker":"工程笔记","downloadCV":"下载 CV","contactIntent":"位于突尼斯 · 寻求国际远程 Backend 与 AI 工程职位。","employmentDates":"软件工程师 · 2026 年 7 月至今","internshipDates":"此前：SpeakDuo 毕业实习 · 2026 年 1 月至 7 月。","achievementFeedback":"开发多语言语法和发音反馈，帮助学习者回顾对话、理解错误，并明确下一步练习的重点。","achievementVoice":"集成实时字幕、翻译和 AI 语音访谈，支持跨语言会话练习，让口语交流更容易理解。","decisionsKicker":"挑战与取舍","decisionsTitle":"这些技术选择的原因。","switchDark":"切换到深色模式","switchLight":"切换到浅色模式","opensNewTab":"在新标签页中打开","technologyLabel":"技术","contactLinksLabel":"联系方式与社交账号","homeLabel":"Taha Chelly 首页","browseNotebook":"浏览工程笔记","navNotebook":"笔记","sectionLink":"此章节的链接","projectSectionsLabel":"项目章节","projectScreenshots":"截图","projectArchitecture":"工作原理","projectDecisions":"技术决策","reciterScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam：诵读者识别界面","verseScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam：经文查找界面","qafiyaDesktopAlt":"Qafiya：电脑上的阿拉伯诗歌分析界面","qafiyaMobileAlt":"Qafiya：手机上的阿拉伯诗歌分析界面","remoteOpportunity":"位于突尼斯 · 寻求国际远程 Backend 与 AI 工程职位。","exploreProjects":"浏览项目","reciterEvidenceContext":"诵读者识别 · 基于 781 个留出音频片段的离线评估；不衡量经文识别。","qafiyaEvidenceContext":"本地容器负载 · 在 512 MiB RAM 限制下，进程 RSS 峰值为 142.55 MiB；并非公共流量基准。","reciterEvidence":"97.31% top-1 · 99.10% top-3","qafiyaEvidence":"4.8 MB · CPU ONNX","achievementPractice":"构建词汇跟踪、复习练习和个性化语法练习，让学习者重新练习对话中遇到的单词和语言结构。","achievementMultiplayer":"交付 AI 聊天和同步小组学习活动，将 backend 服务与网页应用中的互动体验连接起来。","speakduoCaseLabel":"案例研究","speakduoCaseTitle":"让对话成为学习的机会。","speakduoCaseSummary":"AI 聊天、多语言学习内容、词汇工具和互动练习：在 SpeakDuo 的部分贡献。","speakduoCaseLink":"阅读 SpeakDuo 案例","speakduoCaseBack":"← 返回工作经历","speakduoCaseContextTitle":"学习者的需要","speakduoCaseContext":"我在 SpeakDuo 开发 backend 与网页应用中的语言学习功能。以下示例来自我已合并的工作，涵盖 AI 聊天、学习内容、个人练习和小组活动。","speakduoCasePracticeTitle":"个人练习","speakduoCasePractice":"我实现了按计划重复的短语复习，并参与个人语法档案的开发。学习者可以回顾纠错例句、保存练习、继续未完成的学习并查看进度。","speakduoCaseRoleTitle":"我的贡献","speakduoCaseRole":"我的贡献涵盖 Python backend 服务、React 网页界面、集成、测试和已有功能修复。我遵循团队的产品与工程规范，回应评审意见并检查功能行为。","speakduoCaseChatTitle":"AI 聊天机器人","speakduoCaseChat":"我开发了 Ash 的 AI 聊天功能，涵盖 backend 和网页应用，包括对话历史、逐步显示的回复以及会话管理。我也改进了助手的推荐，使其对应平台实际提供的学习功能。","speakduoCaseVoiceTitle":"AI 访谈语音智能体与反馈","speakduoCaseVoice":"我参与 AI 访谈语音智能体的多语言支持，以及语法和发音反馈的开发。我也改进了实时字幕处理，并调整语言反馈，以更好地区分日常口语表达和实际错误。","speakduoCoverAlt":"SpeakDuo 案例封面：以对话气泡、音频波形和书本表现会话、语音与练习。","speakduoCaseLessonsTitle":"生成式 AI 学习内容","speakduoCaseLessons":"我为 AI 课程生成扩展多语言支持，并参与生成故事、对话和语法练习的开发，包括让例句脱离外部上下文也能理解，帮助学习者在语境中练习词语和表达。","speakduoCaseVocabularyTitle":"词汇与阅读工具","speakduoCaseVocabulary":"我构建了词汇跟踪和复习功能，包括保存的单词、翻译历史和词义查询，也参与生成故事与导入文章的阅读体验、单词填空和语法测验。","speakduoCaseActivitiesTitle":"互动小组活动","speakduoCaseActivities":"我实现了趣味问答、Missing Word、Word Connect 和偏好投票等学习活动，涵盖活动功能、主持人控制和学习者互动，支持会话中的共同练习。","communityKicker":"社区参与","communityTitle":"分享我的所学。","communityClub":"First Skills Club 协会","communityLocation":"突尼斯，斯法克斯","communityContext":"一家突尼斯非营利组织，通过同伴带领的 STEAM 活动，帮助青少年学习技术、英语沟通和领导力。","communitySupervisor":"3D 设计主管","communitySupervisorDates":"2022年8月 — 2025年8月","communityCoach":"3D 设计教练","communityCoachDates":"2019年9月 — 2023年6月","communityLink":"LinkedIn 上的 First Skills Club"},"ja":{"languageLabel":"言語","navAbout":"プロフィール","navWork":"仕事","navContact":"連絡先","intro":"こんにちは、タハです","heroTitle":"Backend・AI<br><span>エンジニア。</span>","heroDescription":"本番環境の Python システム、リアルタイム AI 体験、知的なアプリケーションを、API からデプロイまで開発します。","connect":"連絡する","github":"GitHub","currentlyAt":"現在 <a href=\"#work\">SpeakDuo</a> に在籍","role":"ソフトウェアエンジニア","portraitNote":"アイデアを現実の体験に変える","aboutKicker":"少しだけ自己紹介","aboutTitle":"コードを書く人。","aboutText":"チュニジアのスファックスを拠点に活動するソフトウェアエンジニア、Taha Chellyです。わかりやすい画面、信頼できるbackend、そして本当に役立つ機能を形にするまで、製品づくりの全工程に携わるのが好きです。","aboutDetail":"ソフトウェア工学の学位を取得し、FastAPI、SQL、Docker を使った Python backend、REST API、AI アプリケーションの開発経験があります。SpeakDuo で本番稼働する機能の開発に貢献し、AI プロジェクトを一貫して構築してきました。信頼できる backend サービスを開発し、AI engineering の分野で成長できる、フルタイムの Python 開発職を探しています。","tagFullStack":"フルスタック開発","tagAI":"AIアプリケーション","tagRealtime":"リアルタイム体験","workKicker":"取り組んでいること","workTitle":"目的を持って作る。","current":"在籍中","workHeading":"会話を重ねながら、<br>言語学習をサポートします。","workDescription":"SpeakDuo の本番言語学習プラットフォームで、Python サービス、Web アプリ、リアルタイム音声体験にわたる backend と AI 機能を開発しています。","remote":"リモート","toolkitTitle":"使用しているツール","contactKicker":"良いアイデアは会話から","contactTitle":"誰かに話したくなるものを<br><span>一緒に作りましょう。</span>","footerLine":"丁寧に作り、進化を続けています。","backToTop":"ページ上部へ ↑","navProjects":"プロジェクト","projectsKicker":"制作したプロジェクト","projectsTitle":"アイデアを形に。","viewProject":"プロジェクトを見る ↗","projectCategory":"音声認識 · 応用機械学習 · FastAPI","projectSummary":"朗誦者と、今聞いている節を見つける。リアルタイムの音声入力とファイルアップロードに対応したクルアーン朗誦認識アプリ。","backProjects":"← プロジェクト一覧","liveDemo":"デモを試す","sourceCode":"GitHub で見る","screenshotsKicker":"アプリの画面","screenshotsTitle":"朗誦を探る、2つの方法。","reciterCaption":"朗誦者の認識：音声をアップロード、またはリアルタイムで入力。","verseCaption":"節の検索：朗誦から章と節を見つける。","approachKicker":"仕組み","approachTitle":"音声から、一致する朗誦へ。","reciterTitle":"朗誦者を識別","reciterDetail":"ECAPA-TDNN モデルが voice embedding を生成します。ONNX Runtime で inference を実行し、cosine similarity により20人の朗誦者のプロファイルとの一致度を順位付けします。","verseTitle":"節を見つける","verseDetail":"クルアーン向けに調整した Whisper がアラビア語音声を文字に変換。正規化したテキストを6,236節と照合します。","contextTitle":"さらに聞いて判断","contextDetail":"候補が曖昧な場合は、段階的に音声を追加して文脈を集めます。不確かな結果はその旨を表示します。","stackKicker":"技術スタック","stackTitle":"アプリを支える技術。","frontendDetail":"Frontend：React 19 と TypeScript を使い、Vite と Tailwind CSS 4 で構築しています。ブラウザーのマイク録音と音声ファイルのアップロードを API に接続します。","backendDetail":"Backend：Python と FastAPI を使い、WebSockets で朗誦者をリアルタイムに識別します。ONNX Runtime が speaker embeddings の計算を、faster-whisper と CTranslate2 が朗誦の文字起こしを担当します。","deployDetail":"デプロイ：Render 上の Docker containers と、frontend を配信する Nginx を使用します。GitHub Actions で backend と frontend を検証し、変更のあるサービスをデプロイします。","tryTitle":"聞いて、見つける。","qafiyaCategory":"アラビア語 NLP · アルゴリズム · CPU AI","qafiyaSummary":"アラビア詩の工房。古典韻律、脚韻、韻律分析、ローカルでの母音記号補完を試せます。","qafiyaCaptionDesk":"執筆画面 — 古典韻律と脚韻の基準となる文字を選び、詩句を分析します。","qafiyaCaptionMobile":"スマートフォンに対応したアラビア詩分析画面。","qafiyaApproachTitle":"書かれた詩句からリズムへ。","qafiyaAnalysisTitle":"古典韻律を分析","qafiyaAnalysisDetail":"PyArud を使い、16種類の古典韻律に照らしてアラビア詩を確認します。各半句、二進数で表したリズム、韻脚、指定した脚韻の基準文字（rawi）を調べられます。","qafiyaTashkeelTitle":"母音記号をローカルで補完","qafiyaTashkeelDetail":"内蔵の4.8 MB libtashkeel ONNXモデルがCPUで母音記号を補います。入力済みの記号を尊重し、分析ではLLMを呼び出しません。","qafiyaDraftTitle":"詩の生成は実験段階","qafiyaDraftDetail":"任意のプロバイダーが詩を作成し、合格した箇所を保ちながら不合格の句を修正します。公開デモでは生成を無効にしています。","qafiyaFrontend":"Frontend: React 19、TypeScript、Vite。レスポンシブなアラビア語RTL画面です。","qafiyaBackend":"Backend：Python 3.12、FastAPI、PyArud、NumPy、CPU 版 ONNX Runtime を使用します。単一の worker が、利用に上限を設けた inference session を共有します。","qafiyaDeploy":"ホスティング：frontend は Cloudflare Pages、Docker API は Render で稼働します。GitHub Actions で frontend、backend、本番 container を検証します。","qafiyaTryTitle":"韻律と脚韻を探る。","generationPaused":"ライブデモでは分析を利用できます。AI生成は現在無効です。","cvFormat":"PDF · 129 KB","story0Title":"短い音声だけでは判断できないとき","story0Summary":"朗誦者の識別と章句の検索を分け、不確かさを聴取の流れの中で伝える。","story0Section0Title":"2つの問いに、2つの pipeline","story0Section0Text":"声の識別と単語の認識は異なる課題です。Quranic Shazam は ONNX Runtime で ECAPA-TDNN の speaker embeddings を生成し、20人の朗誦者のプロファイルと照合して候補を順位付けします。一方、章句の検索にはクルアーン向けに調整した Whisper モデルを使い、アラビア語の転写を正規化して6,236節と比較します。speaker embeddings のモデルは pretrained の状態で利用しており、クルアーンの録音を使った fine-tuning は行っていません。","story0Section1Title":"確信を示す前に、文脈を増やす","story0Section1Text":"短い朗誦は複数の節に一致する場合があります。段階的な聴取で最大60秒まで音声の文脈を追加し、曖昧な結果には不確かであることを表示します。早い段階で答えを決めつけるのではなく、聴取時間を延ばして判断材料を増やす設計です。","story0Section2Title":"inference を event loop の外で実行する","story0Section2Text":"モデルの inference は API の非同期 event loop の外で実行します。アップロードは25 MBまでとし、認識モードごとに音声の長さにも上限を設けています。これにより処理負荷の高いリクエストを制限しながら、ファイルとライブマイクの両方に対応します。","story0Section3Title":"何を測った結果なのかを明確にする","story0Section3Text":"2026年9月5日の offline 評価では、評価用に分けた781クリップに対して、朗誦者識別の top-1 が97.31%、top-3 が99.10%でした。プロファイル作成用と評価用では異なる章を使っています。これはその朗誦者 benchmark の結果であり、章句認識の精度を測るものでも、あらゆるマイク、雑音、録音での性能を保証するものでもありません。","story1Title":"小さな CPU サーバーでアラビア詩の韻律を分析する","story1Summary":"約4.8 MBの母音記号補完モデル、入力済み記号の尊重、そして自動分析の明確な限界。","story1Section0Title":"利用できるリソースにモデルを合わせる","story1Section0Text":"Qafiya は PyArud による古典韻律分析と、同梱した約4.8 MBの libtashkeel ONNX モデルを組み合わせています。母音記号の補完は CPU 上でローカルに動作し、PyTorch、Transformers、GPU、外部のモデルサーバーを必要としません。単一の Uvicorn worker が、上限を設けて直列実行する inference session を共有し、モデルの複製と同時実行を抑えます。","story1Section1Title":"書き手が入力した本文を守る","story1Section1Text":"すでに入力された母音記号を優先します。自動補完は不足する記号を補い、変更内容を示します。画面には分析に使った本文を表示しつつ、元の入力も保持します。韻律分析は発音に依存するため、推定した母音が1つ変わるだけでも結果が変わり得ます。","story1Section2Title":"container を検証し、結果の範囲を示す","story1Section2Text":"文書化されたローカルテストでは、512 MiB RAM と0.1 CPUの上限を設け、本番イメージで ASGI アプリ全体を通すワークロードを実行しました。process RSS の最大値は142.55 MiBで、out-of-memory は発生しませんでした。これは限定した負荷での結果であり、任意の公開トラフィックでの動作保証ではありません。別の12詩句のサンプルでは、一部に母音記号がある入力の韻律一致が2/12から10/12に改善しましたが、記号がまったくない入力では2/12にとどまりました。","story1Section3Title":"修正回数を制限し、正しい部分を残す","story1Section3Text":"実験的な workflow は韻律と指定した rawi を検証し、不合格の詩句を回数制限付きのループで修正します。backend は合格した詩句と正しい半句を保持します。rawi の一致は古典脚韻の完全な検証ではなく、機械による合格判定も文学的な質を証明しません。公開デモでは AI 生成を引き続き無効にしています。","notebookTitle":"エンジニアリングノート","readNote":"技術ノートを読む","allNotes":"ノート一覧に戻る","noteLabel":"技術ノート","readingTime":"約3分で読めます","articleContext":"プロジェクトの repository に記録された実装上の判断と評価結果を解説します。","contentsLabel":"この記事の内容","sourcesTitle":"出典と実装","sourceReadme":"プロジェクト README","sourceEvidence":"評価と根拠","exploreProject":"プロジェクトを見る","continueReading":"続けて読む","writtenBy":"執筆","writingTitle":"技術的な判断と、その理由。","evidenceCaption":"プロジェクトの README とリンク先の評価資料に基づいています。","copyLink":"リンクをコピー","linkCopied":"リンクをコピーしました","writingKicker":"エンジニアリングノート","downloadCV":"CVをダウンロード","contactIntent":"チュニジア在住 · 国際的なリモートの Backend・AI エンジニア職を希望。","employmentDates":"ソフトウェアエンジニア · 2026年7月〜現在","internshipDates":"それ以前：SpeakDuo 卒業研究インターンシップ · 2026年1月〜7月。","achievementFeedback":"多言語の文法・発音フィードバックを開発し、学習者が会話を振り返り、間違いを理解して次の練習課題を見つけられるようにします。","achievementVoice":"ライブ字幕、翻訳、AI 音声インタビューを統合し、多言語での会話練習や発話内容の理解を支援します。","decisionsKicker":"課題とトレードオフ","decisionsTitle":"技術的な選択の理由。","switchDark":"ダークモードに切り替える","switchLight":"ライトモードに切り替える","opensNewTab":"新しいタブで開きます","technologyLabel":"技術","contactLinksLabel":"連絡先とソーシャルリンク","homeLabel":"Taha Chelly ホーム","browseNotebook":"ノート一覧を見る","navNotebook":"ノート","sectionLink":"このセクションへのリンク","projectSectionsLabel":"プロジェクトの構成","projectScreenshots":"画面","projectArchitecture":"仕組み","projectDecisions":"技術的な判断","reciterScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam：朗誦者の認識画面","verseScreenshotAlt":"Quranic Shazam：節の検索画面","qafiyaDesktopAlt":"Qafiya：デスクトップでのアラビア詩分析画面","qafiyaMobileAlt":"Qafiya：スマートフォンでのアラビア詩分析画面","remoteOpportunity":"チュニジア在住 · 国際的なリモートの Backend・AI エンジニア職を希望。","exploreProjects":"プロジェクトを見る","reciterEvidenceContext":"朗誦者認識 · 未使用の 781 クリップによるオフライン評価。節の認識は測定していません。","qafiyaEvidenceContext":"ローカルコンテナ負荷 · 512 MiB RAM 制限下でプロセス RSS のピークは 142.55 MiB。公開トラフィックのベンチマークではありません。","reciterEvidence":"97.31% top-1 · 99.10% top-3","qafiyaEvidence":"4.8 MB · CPU ONNX","achievementPractice":"語彙の記録、復習問題、個別の文法練習を構築し、会話で出会った単語や言語パターンを再び練習できるようにします。","achievementMultiplayer":"AI チャットと同期したグループ学習活動を提供し、backend サービスを Web アプリのインタラクティブな体験につなげます。","speakduoCaseLabel":"ケーススタディ","speakduoCaseTitle":"会話を学びの機会に変える。","speakduoCaseSummary":"AI チャット、多言語の学習コンテンツ、語彙ツール、対話的な練習。SpeakDuo での主な貢献を紹介します。","speakduoCaseLink":"SpeakDuo の事例を読む","speakduoCaseBack":"← 職務経験に戻る","speakduoCaseContextTitle":"学習者の課題","speakduoCaseContext":"SpeakDuo では backend と Web アプリで言語学習機能を開発しています。以下はマージ済みの仕事から選んだ例で、AI チャット、学習コンテンツ、個人練習、グループ活動を扱います。","speakduoCasePracticeTitle":"個人練習","speakduoCasePractice":"予定に沿って繰り返すフレーズ復習を実装し、個人用文法アーカイブにも携わりました。修正例の振り返り、練習の保存、セッションの再開、進捗の確認ができます。","speakduoCaseRoleTitle":"私の貢献","speakduoCaseRole":"Python backend サービス、React の画面、統合、テスト、既存機能の修正に貢献しました。チームの製品・開発方針に沿い、レビューに対応し、機能の動作を確認しました。","speakduoCaseChatTitle":"AI チャットボット","speakduoCaseChat":"Ash の AI チャットを backend と Web アプリで開発し、会話履歴、段階的な返信表示、会話管理を実装しました。また、実際に提供されている学習機能を助手が勧めるよう改善しました。","speakduoCaseVoiceTitle":"AI インタビュー音声エージェントとフィードバック","speakduoCaseVoice":"AI インタビュー音声エージェントの多言語対応と、文法・発音フィードバックに携わりました。また、ライブ字幕処理と、日常的な口語表現を実際の間違いと区別するフィードバックを改善しました。","speakduoCoverAlt":"SpeakDuo の事例カバー。吹き出し、音声波形、本で会話・音声・練習を表現。","speakduoCaseLessonsTitle":"生成 AI による学習コンテンツ","speakduoCaseLessons":"AI レッスン生成を多言語に拡張し、物語、対話、文法問題の生成にも携わりました。例文が単独で理解でき、文脈の中で単語や表現を練習できるよう改善しました。","speakduoCaseVocabularyTitle":"語彙と読解のツール","speakduoCaseVocabulary":"保存した単語、翻訳履歴、語義検索を含む語彙の記録・復習機能を開発しました。生成した物語や取り込んだ記事の読解体験、単語の穴埋め、文法クイズにも携わりました。","speakduoCaseActivitiesTitle":"対話的なグループ活動","speakduoCaseActivities":"トリビア、Missing Word、Word Connect、好みの投票などの学習活動を実装しました。活動機能、進行役の操作、学習者のやり取りを通じて、セッションでの共同練習を支援します。","communityKicker":"コミュニティ活動","communityTitle":"学んだことを、次の人へ。","communityClub":"First Skills Club 協会","communityLocation":"チュニジア・スファックス","communityContext":"若者が仲間同士で教え合う STEAM 活動を通して、技術、英語でのコミュニケーション、リーダーシップを学ぶチュニジアの非営利団体です。","communitySupervisor":"3Dデザイン・スーパーバイザー","communitySupervisorDates":"2022年8月 — 2025年8月","communityCoach":"3Dデザイン・コーチ","communityCoachDates":"2019年9月 — 2023年6月","communityLink":"LinkedIn の First Skills Club"}};
